0198 123.75 15.198C125.138 13.8011 126.839 13.1898 128.41 13.1898Z" fill="#C4C7C7"></path> </svg> </div></a></div><a class="more" href="/partners"><p>Meer over onze partners</p><div class="sc-f1649a99-0 kPymgC caret"><svg width="10" height="16" viewBox="0 0 10 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M0.792893 0.292893C1.18342 -0.0976311 1.81658 -0.0976311 2.20711 0.292893L9.91421 8L2.20711 15.7071C1.81658 16.0976 1.18342 16.0976 0.792894 15.7071C0.40237 15.3166 0.40237 14.6834 0.792894 14.2929L7.08579 8L0.792893 1.70711C0.402369 1.31658 0.402369 0.683418 0.792893 0.292893Z" fill="currentColor"></path> </svg> </div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json">{"props":{"pageProps":{"preview":false,"pageStatus":"OK","statusCode":200,"pageConfig":{"backgroundColor":"#E6E6E6","colors":{"accent":"#000000","bg":"#FFFFFF","text":"#000000"}},"metaData":{"title":"Plan je bezoek aan Effenaar","description":"","image":null},"dehydrated":{"mutations":[],"queries":[{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":1771,"slug":"/agenda/pink-project-echoes","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/pink-project-echoes","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/pink-project-echoes","en":null},"title":"Pink Project: Echoes","content":"\u003cp\u003eHet publiek wil Pink Floyd horen, in optima forma, en dát is het doel van Pink Project. Al 30 jaar weten zij de muzikale nalatenschap van Pink Floyd vlekkeloos neer te zetten in de theaters en op poppodia. Pink Project zal het publiek tijdens deze show verwennen met een fraaie setlist. Een doorsnee van het rijke Pink Floyd Oeuvre. Een combinatie van songs die niet mogen ontbreken, gecombineerd met verrassende parels.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTijdschema:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e19:30 uur Deuren open\u003cbr\u003e20:30 - 22:30 Pink Project\u003cbr\u003e(Tijden onder voorbehoud)\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Pink Project: Echoes","description":"Op vrijdag 16 oktober staat Pink Project in onze Grote Zaal om de muziek van de legendarische band Pink Floyd springlevend te houden. Dit doen ze al meer dan 30 jaar met veel energie en spectaculaire shows.","image":{"image":{"alt":"Pink Project","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=JUOlsWZW","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=G33c6Gon","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=dX9FKX-0","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=AmzYJLpi","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=amHV3Mz3","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=BGhXDepu"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=JUOlsWZW 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=G33c6Gon 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=dX9FKX-0 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=AmzYJLpi 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png?itok=amHV3Mz3 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-01/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitepinkproject.png