wn Brothers live ziet spelen, wordt onvermijdelijk meegezogen in de muzikale wervelwind die over het podium raast. Hun onweerstaanbare cocktail van rock, folk, blues en soul doet denken aan grootheden als The Band, Creedence Clearwater Revival of The Rolling Stones. Verwacht geen grootse meezingmomenten of uitbundige podiumkapriolen. De Dawn Brothers stralen vooral een heerlijke Rotterdamse no-nonsense mentaliteit uit, met een liefde voor muziek die door iedere ader stroomt.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"Dawn Brothers","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1733216400,"machine":"2024-12-03T09:00:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Dawn Brothers header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-12/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-12/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=2AwYApti","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-12/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=JYikJVc7","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-12/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=JissKWy8","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-12/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=Eo_zUngm","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-12/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=IUGP5_4J","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-12/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=kuGmv_1i"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-12/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=2AwYApti 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-12/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=JYikJVc7 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-12/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=JissKWy8 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/32