elevision\u003c/strong\u003e (UK), \u003cstrong\u003eHelicon\u003c/strong\u003e (UK), Lucy Kruger \u0026amp; The Lost Boys (DE), \u003cstrong\u003eFirefriend\u003c/strong\u003e (BR), \u003cstrong\u003eTravo\u003c/strong\u003e (PT), \u003cstrong\u003eMini Skirt\u003c/strong\u003e (AU), \u003cstrong\u003eStrange Lot\u003c/strong\u003e (US), \u003cstrong\u003eKombynat Robotron\u003c/strong\u003e (DE), \u003cstrong\u003eThe Dharma Chain\u003c/strong\u003e (DE/AU) \u003cstrong\u003eGum Takes Tooth \u003c/strong\u003e(UK), \u003cstrong\u003eServo\u003c/strong\u003e (FR), \u003cstrong\u003eSunflowers\u003c/strong\u003e (PT), \u003cstrong\u003epôt-pot\u003c/strong\u003e (IE/PT), \u003cstrong\u003eGolden Hours \u003c/strong\u003e(BE/DE), \u003cstrong\u003eFlying Moon In Space\u003c/strong\u003e (DE) and \u003cstrong\u003eLos Palms\u003c/strong\u003e (AU).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"cta","id":"1cac66ad-581e-4a38-8ed3-84b28cd6581e","header":{"title":"Tickets for Fuzz Club Eindhoven 2026: Day tickets and tier 3 weekend tickets are now on sale","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFRIDAY\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA Place To Bury Strangers, Minami Deutsch, Glyders, Lorelle Meets The Obsolete, Japanese Television, Mini Skirt, Strange Lot,\u0026nbsp;pôt-pot,\u0026nbsp;Lucy Kruger \u0026amp; The Lost Boys, Travo, Sunflowers, Flying Moon In Space\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSATURDAY\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eW.I.T.C.H, Dead Skeletons, L.A. Witch, Causa Sui, Firefriend, The Spyrals, Helicon, Kombynat Robotron, Gum Takes Tooth, Servo,\u0026nbsp;The Dharma Chain, Golden Hours, Los Palms.\u003c/p\u003e"},"content":{"cta_title":"Fuzz Club Eindhoven 2026 - weekend \u0026 day tickets","cta_description":{"value":"\u003cp\u003e1 \u0026amp; 2 May 2026\u003cbr\u003eEarly Bird weekend ticket:\u0026nbsp;€126 (sold out)\u003cbr\u003eWeekend ticket tier 2: €136 (sold out)\u003cbr\u003eWeekend ticket tier 3: €146\u003cbr\u003eFriday ticket: €81\u003cbr\u003eSaturday ticket: €86\u003c/p\u003e","format":"basic_html","processed":"\u003cp\u003e1 \u0026amp; 2 May 2026\u003cbr\u003eEarly Bird weekend ticket:\u0026nbsp;€126 (sold out)\u003cbr\u003eWeekend ticket tier 2: €136 (sold out)\u003cbr\u003eWeekend ticket tier 3: €146\u003cbr\u003eFriday ticket: €81\u003cbr\u003eSaturday ticket: €86\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"url":{"uri":"https://shop.tickets.cm.com/97b77e6f-b520-a12b-739b-08864388a8bd","title":"Click here to order","options":{"url":"https://shop.tickets.cm.com/97b77e6f-b520-a12b-739b-08864388a8bd"}},"description":{"value":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFRIDAY\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA Place To Bury Strangers, Minami Deutsch, Glyders, Lorelle Meets The Obsolete, Japanese Television, Mini Skirt, Strange Lot,\u0026nbsp;pôt-pot,\u0026nbsp;Lucy Kruger \u0026amp; The Lost Boys, Travo, Sunflowers, Flying Moon In Space\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSATURDAY\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eW.I.T.C.H, Dead Skeletons, L.A. Witch, Causa Sui, Firefriend, The Spyrals, Helicon, Kombynat Robotron, Gum Takes Tooth, Servo,\u0026nbsp;The Dharma Chain, Golden Hours, Los Palms.\u003c/p\u003e","format":"basic_html","processed":{"web":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFRIDAY\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA Place To Bury Strangers, Minami Deutsch, Glyders, Lorelle Meets The Obsolete, Japanese Television, Mini Skirt, Strange Lot,\u0026nbsp;pôt-pot,\u0026nbsp;Lucy Kruger \u0026amp; The Lost Boys, Travo, Sunflowers, Flying Moon In Space\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSATURDAY\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eW.I.T.C.H, Dead Skeletons, L.A. Witch, Causa Sui, Firefriend, The Spyrals, Helicon, Kombynat Robotron, Gum Takes Tooth, Servo,\u0026nbsp;The Dharma Chain, Golden Hours, Los Palms.\u003c/p\u003e\n","app":"FRIDAYA Place To Bury Strangers, Minami Deutsch, Glyders, Lorelle Meets The Obsolete, Japanese Television, Mini Skirt, Strange Lot,\u0026nbsp;pôt-pot,\u0026nbsp;Lucy Kruger \u0026amp; The Lost Boys, Travo, Sunflowers, Flying Moon In Space\u0026nbsp;SATURDAYW.I.T.C.H, Dead Skeletons, L.A. Witch, Causa Sui, Firefriend, The Spyrals, Helicon, Kombynat Robotron, Gum Takes Tooth, Servo,\u0026nbsp;The Dharma Chain, Golden Hours, Los Palms.\n"}},"title":"Tickets for Fuzz Club Eindhoven 2026: Day tickets and tier 3 weekend tickets are now on sale"}},{"type":"effenaar_image","id":"65173aa5-dc2e-4965-b912-8633ec02d5bc","header":{"title":"Timetable Fuzz Club 2026","description":null},"content":{"image":{"image":{"alt":"Timetable Fuzz Club 2026","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=8qlNuYtX","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=yMDrsIng","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=seJQcFTh","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=Ap1niq0z","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=kpqEVD2W","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=yZ8e744D"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=8qlNuYtX 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=yMDrsIng 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=seJQcFTh 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=Ap1niq0z 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=kpqEVD2W 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-04/FC2026_Stage_Times_Horizontal.png?itok=yZ8e744D 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"is_fullscreen":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"66811ce0-6ac1-43c0-8a19-afa9976a04d7","header":{"title":"L.A. Witch"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eL.A. Witch have always exuded an aura of effortless cool whether it manifested as the Americana noir and laconic back-to-basics rock ’n roll of their self-titled debut or the blistering austere adventurism of their sophomore album 'Play With Fire'. On latest album 'DOGGOD', the trio stretch their sound beyond familiar borders. Recorded in Paris, the record leans into darker, broader sonic terrain and cosmic, existential themes, while retaining L.A. Witch’s unmistakable atmosphere of menace, mystique and magnetic restraint.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"L.A. Witch","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=YeDwYKc-","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=uQPcJXJ0","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=zsZocUOA","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=cG-i0Jt7","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=0IxIb42U","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=H9au0udE"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=YeDwYKc- 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=uQPcJXJ0 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=zsZocUOA 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=cG-i0Jt7 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=0IxIb42U 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-01/LA%20Witch%201080x1350.jpg?itok=H9au0udE 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"cec16a83-8802-457b-a50e-46079d044574","header":{"title":"W.I.T.C.H."},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eAmong the first names announced are festival headliners W.I.T.C.H (We Intend To Cause Havoc). Known as the “Zambian Beatles,” W.I.T.C.H were the founding force behind the Zamrock movement of the ’70s and early ’80s and have continued to captivate audiences since reforming just over a decade ago. Met with ever-growing, rapturous crowds, their return has also brought the first new W.I.T.C.H music in decades with 2023’s \u003cem\u003eZango\u003c/em\u003e and this year’s \u003cem\u003eSOGOLO\u003c/em\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"WITCH square","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=3FKTY0mu","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=AbJqrhEe","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=X-WVHTzz","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=_H8rAZdF","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=9G5bRJBP","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=unxt6cRe"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=3FKTY0mu 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=AbJqrhEe 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=X-WVHTzz 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=_H8rAZdF 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=9G5bRJBP 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/WITCH%201080x1450.png?itok=unxt6cRe 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"f87b685c-75e5-47cc-8296-878d857240b0","header":{"title":"A Place To Bury Strangers"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eBrooklyn noise-rock juggernauts A Place To Bury Strangers return nearly eight years after tearing up the festival’s first edition in 2018, leaving ears ringing ever since. Formed in 2003 from Oliver Ackermann’s psychotropic vision, the band quickly became a force of beautiful chaos. Often called \u003cem\u003ethe loudest band in New York\u003c/em\u003e, APTBS are known for live shows filled with blinding visuals, experimental sonic warfare, and the occasional bit of stage destruction. On record, it’s pop hooks tangled in the sounds of broken machinery and syrupy distortion.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"A Place To Bury Strangers 1080x1350","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=eSuQifVr","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=mx6HnoaM","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=xRZbAAMW","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=5iGqCiuE","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=pYB_0J8F","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=IcPsIjSh"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=eSuQifVr 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=mx6HnoaM 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=xRZbAAMW 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=5iGqCiuE 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=pYB_0J8F 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/APTBS%201080x1350.png?itok=IcPsIjSh 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"a8d14bee-574e-4150-9758-f7ba0dddb140","header":{"title":"Dead Skeletons"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eIceland’s art-psych cult heroes Dead Skeletons first appeared in 2008, when artist Jón Sæmundur created the iconic “Dead Mantra” as a spiritual battle hymn for an art installation - unwittingly setting off a wave of underground devotion that led to their now-legendary LP \u003cem\u003eDead Magick\u003c/em\u003e. Conceived as an art project rather than a conventional band, they nevertheless found themselves touring the world, bringing their hypnotic and immersive rituals to anyone ready to join in. After disappearing from the stage for years - much like the comet that inspired their 2013 Dead Comet Tour - Dead Skeletons reunited in 2025, proving that some forces simply refuse to fade.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"Dead Skeletons 1080x1350","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=U0vXi5N5","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=-ZHyDwWj","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=6ej10RY9","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=67TntB9p","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=MSrX27_q","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=Zf_ld4oN"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=U0vXi5N5 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=-ZHyDwWj 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=6ej10RY9 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=67TntB9p 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=MSrX27_q 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-12/Dead%20Skeletons.png?itok=Zf_ld4oN 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"eac31932-cba5-4924-9940-a07d30129631","header":{"title":"Causa Sui"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDanish stoner-psych outfit Causa Sui will make a rare live appearance this year, celebrating twenty years since their debut. Their sound has been described as a giant wave rolling through the last four decades of rock, blending groove-heavy jams reminiscent of \u003cem\u003eGrateful Dead\u003c/em\u003e with ambient textures, cinematic scope, and a clear nod to early 70s German Krautrock (think \u003cem\u003eAsh Ra Tempel\u003c/em\u003e, \u003cem\u003eCan\u003c/em\u003e, and \u003cem\u003ePopol Vuh)\u003c/em\u003e. After the tropical haze of \u003cem\u003eSzabodelico\u003c/em\u003e and the kaleidoscopic sprawl of \u003cem\u003eFrom The Source\u003c/em\u003e, they return with \u003cem\u003eIn Flux\u003c/em\u003e, a 50-minute journey of fluid grooves, chiming guitars, and psychedelic keys that flow from pastoral calm to cosmic intensity.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"Causa Sui ","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=eMGGobrQ","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=bq-GvUDl","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=IN8OqgGN","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=hAlrFY3P","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=lmD2cGXv","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=g5v8j-hn"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=eMGGobrQ 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=bq-GvUDl 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=IN8OqgGN 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=hAlrFY3P 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=lmD2cGXv 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/Causa%20Sui%201080x1350.png?itok=g5v8j-hn 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"9ac7a1c7-fb70-47d0-88ac-ef7b893a271b","header":{"title":"Minami Deutsch"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eMinami Deutsch channel the motorik spirit of Can, Neu! and Kraftwerk into something entirely their own. The Japanese trio blend krautrock and psychedelia soaked in 70s influences with a touch of modern electronics. The result is a hypnotic swirl of repetitive grooves that suddenly erupt into sizzling fuzz-rock. Formed in 2014 amid the chaos of Tokyo’s streets, the band was quickly picked up by Tokyo Psych Fest. After a few impressive shows here, they’re now ready to bring their mesmerizing live set to Fuzz Club Festival.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"Minami Deutsch","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=t7V00vhx","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=qPndC6Ff","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=vSx1cSRE","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=71FxUVf-","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=YTUM12Ft","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=2PnV5214"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=t7V00vhx 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=qPndC6Ff 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=vSx1cSRE 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=71FxUVf- 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=YTUM12Ft 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/Minami%20Deutsch.png?itok=2PnV5214 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"76088361-a875-43b9-a906-f49751168223","header":{"title":"Lorelle Meets the Obsolete"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eThe Mexican group Lorelle Meets the Obsolete sound like they’ve raided every corner of the psychedelic attic, from jangly ‘60s folk-rock to fuzzed-out biker jams, and rewired it all through a wall of ‘90s noise and avant-garde electronics. What began as a duo conjuring murky, hypnotic soundscapes out of cramped city apartments in Guadalajara and Mexico City slowly evolved into something stranger and more expansive. After relocating to the calmer landscapes of Baja, their music loosened its grip on traditional psych and moved into more experimental territory, weaving in dub-like space, industrial grit, and an ever-growing love for synths.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"Lorelle Meets the Obsolete","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-10/Lorelle.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=oEK48xH_","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=Epfqb8ej","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=5bRaRQe0","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=mAgPqDWT","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=Jk_k6D0u","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=ucH9VQnS"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=oEK48xH_ 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=Epfqb8ej 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=5bRaRQe0 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=mAgPqDWT 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=Jk_k6D0u 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/Lorelle.png?itok=ucH9VQnS 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"7f2091e2-7a10-4c06-8eed-4125f739cbc1","header":{"title":"Glyders"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eFormed in Chicago by partners Josh Condon and Eliza Weber, Glyders make stripped-down rock and roll that feels both lean and lush, humming with a kind of nocturnal mystery. Joined by Joe Seger on drums, they channel classic influences but twist them into something stranger: music that sways and grinds, mellow yet charged, drifting along the backroads of American weirdness.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"Glijders","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-10/Glyders.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=ct2RHnMf","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=qk8v_EzB","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=lYdaiW67","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=Mp1zGD2_","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=J4In1TS5","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=0qwsRxda"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=ct2RHnMf 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=qk8v_EzB 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=lYdaiW67 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=Mp1zGD2_ 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=J4In1TS5 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-10/Glyders.png?itok=0qwsRxda 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"46cd7888-8bc4-4d64-8f02-5f3e843f4d9f","header":{"title":"The Spyrals"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eFormed in San Francisco in 2009 and now based in Los Angeles, The Spyrals are a psychedelic garage-blues band led by Jeff Lewis. Known for their raw, self-recorded albums and high-energy live shows, they’ve spent over a decade honing a sound that’s loud, live, and real. Their new album, \u003cem\u003eRetrograde\u003c/em\u003e, blends the grit of their early recordings with spaced-out, psychedelic grooves, proving that even after five albums, they’re still turning amps up to eleven.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"The Spyrals 1080x1350","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=gdGPTdAc","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=f8cHqpss","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=pyZ_bbHL","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=3DNltnzx","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=UZwd5a34","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=85l5NEh5"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=gdGPTdAc 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=f8cHqpss 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=pyZ_bbHL 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=3DNltnzx 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=UZwd5a34 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-12/The%20Spyrals.png?itok=85l5NEh5 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"e5491cc6-4e21-48bb-9235-77d0084a7d41","header":{"title":"Japanese Television"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eInformed by UFO encounters, ritualism, robots, Northern Soul and solar flares, space-surf-psych-rock quartet Japanese Television continue the quest to spread their fuzzy gospel.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"Japanese Television","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=C9IWIyLp","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=XwV7M-zW","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=n8aPvQLw","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=Yz8af1Q8","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=SmaBpmuh","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=xoS-IGfg"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=C9IWIyLp 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=XwV7M-zW 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=n8aPvQLw 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=Yz8af1Q8 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=SmaBpmuh 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-12/Japanese%20Television.jpg?itok=xoS-IGfg 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"0570edd0-dd17-4fb6-94c8-e8f0ab1d0062","header":{"title":"Listen to the official playlist","description":"\u003cp\u003eGet to know all bands and stream the official playlist!\u003c/p\u003e"},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe data-testid=\"embed-iframe\" style=\"border-radius:12px\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/playlist/4V8ANQfUHWVV70z7JNLSvF?utm_source=generator\" width=\"100%\" height=\"352\" frameBorder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"55ad24f5-aa1f-4212-b193-76ea9a8da557","header":{"title":"About Fuzz Club"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eFuzz Club is a London-based independent record label established in 2012 that has since become a crucial catalyst in the international psych community. Under Fuzz Club and its recently-launched Bad Vibrations and Rubber Duck imprints, they are home to the likes of The Jesus and Mary Chain, Night Beats, Tess Parks, Crows, The Men, ORB, The Telescopes, Elephant Stone, Beans, The Vacant Lots, C.O.F.F.I.N and The Underground Youth, to name a few.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThey have also previously released music by the likes of The Black Angels, A Place To Bury Strangers, Holy Wave, Dead Skeletons, Alan Vega, Anton Newcombe, Sonic Boom and many more. Over the last few years, their cult following has expanded thanks to an ongoing series of deluxe, highly sought-after King Gizzard \u0026amp; The Lizard Wizard official live bootlegs. After hosting various events and festivals in London in their earlier years, in 2018 they launched the first Fuzz Club Festival held at the Effenaar in Eindhoven. A now-annual two-day celebration of fuzz, reverb and drone, previous editions have brought together music lovers travelling to attend from nearly 40 different countries.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"Sam Wiehl","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=kMI5gCFe","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=IciTeh45","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=8V9cMgFM","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=DCuxwiUf","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=9115UihW","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=Zm05ewUl"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=kMI5gCFe 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=IciTeh45 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=8V9cMgFM 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=DCuxwiUf 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=9115UihW 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=Zm05ewUl 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":124,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724604457,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-fuzz-club-2026-1may-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-fuzz-club-2026-1may-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"news","nid":1226,"slug":"/nieuws/effenaar-en-4dr-studios-gaan-samenwerking-aan-met-cortex2-om-concertervaringen-te","endpoint":"/nl/nieuws/effenaar-en-4dr-studios-gaan-samenwerking-aan-met-cortex2-om-concertervaringen-te","translations":{"nl":"/nieuws/effenaar-en-4dr-studios-gaan-samenwerking-aan-met-cortex2-om-concertervaringen-te","en":null},"title":"Effenaar en 4DR Studios gaan samenwerking aan met CORTEX2 om concertervaringen te revolutioneren met hybride technologie","content":"","meta":{"title":"Effenaar en 4DR Studios gaan samenwerking aan met CORTEX2 om concertervaringen te revolutioneren met hybride technologie","description":"Lees hier alles over het CORTEX2-project.","image":{"image":{"alt":"hiigo","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=QuzG0Fvo","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=JKGekqt2","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=Yn-hul-C","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=6VR_fW1j","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=mRUiaItW","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=iLJk0o0x"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=QuzG0Fvo 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=JKGekqt2 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=Yn-hul-C 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=6VR_fW1j 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=mRUiaItW 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=iLJk0o0x 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null}},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1730899265,"machine":"2024-11-06T13:21:05+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":true,"header_image":null,"breadcrumb":null,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"46f583a2-4d27-49d5-af00-dcd2cb723cc2","header":{"title":null},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEffenaar en pioniers in immersieve technologie, \u003ca href=\"https://www.4drstudios.com/\"\u003e4DR Studios\u003c/a\u003e, verleggen hun grenzen. Samen met het innovatieve platform \u003ca href=\"https://cortex2.eu/\"\u003eCORTEX2\u003c/a\u003e zetten ze zich in om de concertbeleving te transformeren – niet door live optredens te vervangen, maar door deze te verrijken met hybride technologie.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003eGeselecteerd uit meer dan 147 kandidaten, behoren Effenaar en 4DR Studios tot de weinigen die mogen deelnemen aan de volgende fase van het CORTEX2-programma; een initiatief dat technologische innovatie stimuleert. Deze samenwerking markeert een belangrijke sprong voorwaarts in hybride concertbelevingen.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"8b7d28da-e987-453d-8a1c-c11346893739","header":{"title":"Grensverleggende muziekbelevingen"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDoor de fysieke en digitale wereld te combineren, bieden hybride concerten fans een diepere, meer meeslepende ervaring. Concertgangers kunnen op geheel nieuwe manieren betrokken zijn bij optredens, waarbij de energie van een liveshow wordt gecombineerd met innovatieve digitale elementen. Of je nu persoonlijk aanwezig bent of virtueel deelneemt, het publiek kan nu in een interactieve omgeving contact maken met artiesten, wat de traditionele concertbeleving naar een nieuw niveau tilt.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"2a9a3eac-a020-4efc-85f8-b3b837553d27","header":{"title":"De kracht van ‘Volumetric Capture’"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eEen belangrijk onderdeel van deze transformatie is ‘volumetric capture’. 4DR Studios maakt gebruik van deze geavanceerde technologie om levensechte 3D-representaties van artiesten te creëren, zodat het publiek concerten kan beleven zoals nooit tevoren. Met ‘volumetric capture’ kunnen artiesten digitaal ‘tot leven worden gebracht’ en op zowel fysiek als virtueel niveau met fans interactie aangaan. Stel je voor dat je je favoriete artiest niet alleen op het podium ziet, maar ook als holografische verschijning. Hiermee worden fans ondergedompeld in een volledig interactieve en multidimensionale ervaring.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"d3988a7c-039a-487c-95ce-b21bc3f29597","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LW37h1lXfWQ?si=7IY-z1_Q20UcnGPv\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"9b265757-b33a-45da-bc49-0cb6bdd413fa","header":{"title":"Steve Vai: Van podium naar studio"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eHet project heeft de interesse gewekt van de legendarische gitarist Steve Vai, die zich bij het initiatief heeft aangesloten als mentor en coach. Vai, bekend om zijn innovatieve benadering van muziek, zal zijn expertise en creatieve visie inzetten om de toekomst van hybride concertbelevingen vorm te geven. Zijn betrokkenheid garandeert dat de artistieke integriteit van live optredens behouden blijft, terwijl er nieuwe digitale mogelijkheden worden verkend.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"2073e22d-be8f-4586-9e89-0880f824aac0","header":{"title":"Effenaar's Lab voor innovatie"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eEffenaar is ook niet onbekend met experimenteren. Met \u003ca href=\"https://www.effenaar.nl/effenaar-lab\"\u003eEffenaar Lab\u003c/a\u003e heeft het poppodium jarenlange ervaring met immersieve toepassingen voor muziek en loopt het voorop in het onderzoeken van hoe technologie de muziekervaring kan verrijken. Deze nieuwe samenwerking is een verdere uitbreiding van hun inzet om de grenzen van muziekbeleving te verleggen.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"image_carousel","id":"63bf0e98-1d88-4421-aee8-f8d013bb859c","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"items":[{"image":{"alt":"hiigo","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=QuzG0Fvo","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=JKGekqt2","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=Yn-hul-C","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=6VR_fW1j","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=mRUiaItW","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=iLJk0o0x"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=QuzG0Fvo 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=JKGekqt2 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=Yn-hul-C 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=6VR_fW1j 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=mRUiaItW 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-11/20231028-WWF_9321%20%281%29_0.png?itok=iLJk0o0x 720w"]},"source":"Foto: Patrick Spruytenberg | Hybrid Music Vibes project Hiigo","source_link":null}]}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"8b6f4ed8-d9a6-4fa8-ac36-234fda99c381","header":{"title":"Een nieuw tijdperk voor live muziek"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eMuziek is altijd een essentieel onderdeel geweest van de menselijke ervaring, waarbij live concerten voor veel fans een hoogtepunt vormen. De energie, de sfeer en de kans om je favoriete artiest van dichtbij te zien zijn momenten die al decennia lang gekoesterd worden. Terwijl andere sectoren snelle technologische ontwikkelingen omarmen, is de live muziekervaring grotendeels ongewijzigd gebleven – tot nu.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003eDeze samenwerking markeert het begin van een nieuw tijdperk voor liveshows, waarbij betrokkenheid wordt vergroot zonder afbreuk te doen aan de authenticiteit van de optredens. Effenaar, 4DR Studios en CORTEX2 zijn toegewijd aan het verleggen van de grenzen van wat mogelijk is in de wereld van entertainment, zodat de concertbeleving meegroeit met technologische vooruitgang.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"bc1cda32-4a29-45ec-8851-f26a434c597c","header":{"title":"CORTEX2"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eHet CORTEX2-project is een Europees gesubsidieerd initiatief onder het Horizon Europe-programma, gericht op het verbeteren van Extended Reality (XR) voor efficiëntere samenwerking op afstand, zoals virtuele 3D-omgevingen, gebarenherkenning, meertalige vertaling in real-time en privacybescherming van gegevens. Het project richt zich op een breed scala aan sectoren en hoopt hiermee XR-technologie breder toegankelijk te maken voor bedrijven.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}}],"location":null,"colors":{"accent_color":"#000000","background_color":"#FFFFFF","text_color":"#000000"}},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":33,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724492849,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"NewsDetail-effenaar-en-4dr-studios-gaan-samenwerking-aan-met-cortex2-om-concertervaringen-te-nl","queryHash":"[\"NewsDetail-effenaar-en-4dr-studios-gaan-samenwerking-aan-met-cortex2-om-concertervaringen-te-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":738,"slug":"/agenda/meltheads","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/meltheads","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/meltheads","en":null},"title":"Meltheads","content":"\u003cp\u003eMeltheads is een jong Antwerps viertal dat met bakken talent en evenveel drang en branie als een lopend vuurtje door de Lage Landen gaat. Voortgestuwd door de metronomisch strakke ritmesectie van Tim Penseart (bas) en Simon de Geus (drum), en aangevuurd door de snedige en virtuoze gitaar van Yunas de Proost. Met als gloeiende middelpunt frontman Sietse Willems, die lijkt op de vleesgeworden bastaard van Jim Morrison’s charisma, Robert Plant’s sexappeal en Iggy Pop’s razernij.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"Meltheads in Stroomhuis","description":"De Antwerpse garagerockers/postpunkers van Meltheads gaan hard; afgelopen tijd zetten ze zalen en festivals in lichterlaaie en brachten ze hun debuutplaat uit, wat alvast lovende kritieken vergelijkingen met The Stooges, Nirvana, Amyl and the Sniffers en FIDLAR opleverde. Op zaterdag 9 maart spelen ze in Stroomhuis, mogelijk de laatste dat je deze band in zo’n kleine setting ziet!","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1699260900,"machine":"2023-11-06T08:55:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Meltheads header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=yrIBEFvi","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=Lruz87up","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=eEzPg_17","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=o2GigHlz","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=jnyJHDYe","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=-n-LyyXo"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=yrIBEFvi 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=Lruz87up 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=eEzPg_17 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=o2GigHlz 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=jnyJHDYe 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.png?itok=-n-LyyXo 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"colors":{"accent_color":"#000D91","background_color":"#FBF6D2","text_color":"#000000"},"thumbnail_image":{"image":{"alt":"Meltheads square","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-11/Naamloos-1%20square.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-11/Naamloos-1%20square.png?itok=sGxndWMg","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-11/Naamloos-1%20square.png?itok=mTAe6Wqy","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-11/Naamloos-1%20square.png?itok=beNqLHIt","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-11/Naamloos-1%20square.png?itok=POsEEKSW","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.