X 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-06/%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only.jpg?itok=9lROZ0UO 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-06/%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only.jpg?itok=IPm4wTVU 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-06/%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only.jpg?itok=P9_UJ5Pu 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"locations":[{"id":141,"title":"Altstadt","is_external":false}],"state":null,"club_card_event":true,"colors":{"accent_color":"#285d33","background_color":"#e7f0f1","text_color":"#000000"}}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"ae816a7e-ec61-4cb2-bac2-3f0f3101e28e","header":{"title":"Tijdschema"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003e19:30 Deuren open\u003cbr\u003e20:00-20:30 Solarcycles\u003cbr\u003e20:45-21:15 Vanaheim\u003cbr\u003e21:45-23:15 Battle Beast\u003cbr\u003e(tijden zijn onder voorbehoud)\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"ccd6c4c6-2b59-4926-a2d8-67b5be6f1bd0","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C7Z-IP2onYQ?si=yyitDHpvxStkNJSE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"embed","id":"c3719c53-5a71-4c38-b3b0-a4090c5c2297","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe style=\"border-radius:12px\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/artist/7k5jeohQCF20a8foBD9ize?utm_source=generator\" width=\"100%\" height=\"352\" frameBorder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"2785e44f-944e-4aae-a3b6-475e48c4c8d4","header":{"title":"Support: Vanaheim"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eSinds 2015 brengt het in Tilburg opgerichte Vanaheim een energieke mix van folk met melodieuze, orkestrale invloeden. Met teksten die gebaseerd zijn op folklore en oude fantasy verhalen groeide de band uit van tours op kleinschalig niveau naar shows voor het grotere publiek. Het conceptalbum 'Een Verloren Verhaal' weet deze ontwikkeling goed weer te geven. Het hogere niveau van de band hoor je namelijk terug in een bredere variatie binnen arangementen, een hoogwaardigere productie en meer akoestische stukken. Eerder speelden ze op o.a. Wacken Open Air en Graspop Metal Meeting, deze keer komen ze schitteren als support van Battle Beast.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"vanaheim","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=gr871--l","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=g1ZWhL6A","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=i9aGuiA5","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=qv1-EfpN","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=ZnMlCN09","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=fgnkMawt"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=gr871--l 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=g1ZWhL6A 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=i9aGuiA5 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=qv1-EfpN 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=ZnMlCN09 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-04/vanaheim%20.jpg?itok=fgnkMawt 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"0325c390-d419-4393-b998-33ed5b311da5","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hUZ7glnLw2E?si=NnSbnSMSyxYks8Fh\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"cc7393d6-0d26-4771-aaae-448c82365cf7","header":{"title":"Support: Solarcycles"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eOok komt de Nederlandse folkmetalband Solarcycles mee. De band staat bekend om hun unieke melancholische geluid en betekenisvolle teksten, die emoties, verborgen kennis, spiritualiteit en maatschappijkritische thema’s belichten en de nadruk leggen op de verbinding tussen mens en natuur. Frontvrouw Sascha’s emotionele vocalen worden vaak vergeleken met die van artiesten als Florence Welch (Florence and the Machine) en Dolores O'Riordan (The Cranberries), en creëren een meeslepende ervaring die het publiek in zijn greep houdt. Maak je klaar voor een opvallende stijl die de grenzen van genres overstijgt, met een knipoog naar bands als Children of Bodom, Within Temptation en Evanescence.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"solarcycles","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-04/solarc.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=4VaY4x0w","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=V3IR1oDI","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=Y6OFR0YZ","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=gwXepiH_","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=eHaoVQuz","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=yk2XU38h"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=4VaY4x0w 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=V3IR1oDI 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=Y6OFR0YZ 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=gwXepiH_ 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=eHaoVQuz 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-04/solarc.jpg?itok=yk2XU38h 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"40747869-6824-4837-af58-35228dc6a87a","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T4T1yfk2Fqg?si=liRyKGMGWvCN9jED\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\r\n","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":68,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724834090,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-battle-beast-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-battle-beast-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":1834,"slug":"/agenda/blood-red-shoes","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/blood-red-shoes","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/blood-red-shoes","en":null},"title":"Blood Red Shoes","content":"\u003cp\u003eHet aantal écht iconische rockduo’s is maar klein. Blood Red Shoes kun je echter moeiteloos toevoegen aan het rijtje van The White Stripes, The Black Keys en The Kills. Al twintig jaar bewijzen Laura-Mary Carter (gitaar en zang) en Steven Ansell (drums en zang) dat je met z’n tweeën net zo goed een nietsontziende muur van geluid kunt neerzetten.\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Blood Red Shoes in Effenaar","description":"Het aantal écht iconische rockduo’s is klein, maar Blood Red Shoes hoort moeiteloos in het rijtje van The White Stripes, The Black Keys en The Kills. Al twintig jaar bewijzen Laura-Mary Carter en Steven Ansell dat je met z’n tweeën net zo goed een muur van geluid neerzet. Dit jaar vieren ze hun jubileum met een intieme clubshow vol genadeloze riffs en indie-anthems.\r\n","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1774342500,"machine":"2026-03-24T08:55:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Blood Red Shoes header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-03/Blood%20Red%20Shoes%201920x1080.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-03/Blood%20Red%20Shoes%201920x1080.jpg?itok=H7ucqO1c","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-03/Blood%20Red%20Shoes%201920x1080.jpg?itok=dS4HXBg5","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-03/Blood%20Red%20Shoes%201920x1080.jpg?itok=yC76-rQt","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-03/Blood%20Red%20Shoes%201920x1080.jpg?itok=vjFKnrg4","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-03/Blood%20Red%20Shoes%201920x1080.jpg?itok=TcvhN77J","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-03/Blood%20Red%20Shoes%201920x1080.jpg?itok=1pDwM3ST"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-03/Blood%20Red%20Shoes%201920x1080.jpg?itok=H7ucqO1c 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.