","header":{"title":null},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eVoortgestuwd door de metronomisch strakke ritmesectie van Tim Penseart (bas) en Simon de Geus (drum), en aangevuurd door de snedige en virtuoze gitaar van Yunas de Proost. Met als gloeiende middelpunt frontman Sietse Willems, die lijkt op de vleesgeworden bastaard van Jim Morrison’s charisma, Robert Plant’s sexappeal en Iggy Pop’s razernij.\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"fb96d9ab-344a-44e0-9da5-d9db67e9eb16","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TdD1SoiBeKI?si=4k6zJvMybj_x6qZW\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"embed","id":"33bd6a43-d90f-440e-8e88-908236d0e672","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe data-testid=\"embed-iframe\" style=\"border-radius:12px\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/artist/1d2hZR4CCxI91sG7Q7HD7W?utm_source=generator\u0026si=37d4b52ae3a64570\" width=\"100%\" height=\"352\" frameBorder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":156,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724710323,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-meltheads-11mrt-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-meltheads-11mrt-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":1783,"slug":"/agenda/katherine-priddy","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/katherine-priddy","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/katherine-priddy","en":null},"title":"Katherine Priddy","content":"\u003cp\u003eAls een van de meest veelbelovende nieuwkomers binnen de Engelse folk maakt Katherine Priddy ingetogen liedjes waarin haar dromerige stemgeluid je weet te raken. Niemand minder dan Richard Thompson (Fairport Convention) mag ze al als een van haar fans rekenen. \u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Katherine Priddy","description":"Als een van de meest veelbelovende nieuwkomers binnen de Engelse folk maakt Katherine Priddy ingetogen liedjes waarin haar dromerige stemgeluid je weet te raken. Niemand minder dan Richard Thompson (Fairport Convention) mag ze al als een van haar fans rekenen. ","image":{"image":{"alt":"katherine priddy header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-02/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20katherine%20p.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-02/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20katherine%20p.png?itok=nVgT_LbZ","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-02/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20katherine%20p.png?itok=TsKArXkI","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-02/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20katherine%20p.png?itok=-BWgbwDF","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-02/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20katherine%20p.png?itok=1Pbk4Mku","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-02/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20katherine%20p.png?itok=Zk_5erkJ","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-02/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20katherine%20p.png?itok=7bIi1Qvw"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-02/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20katherine%20p.png?itok=nVgT_LbZ 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-02/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20katherine%20p.png?itok=TsKArXkI 1920