e,"colors":{"accent_color":"#8DA1A6","background_color":"#0D0D0D","text_color":"#FFFFFF"}}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"fe2d3299-01b9-44d5-8ca2-aabd391e5a14","header":{"title":null},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eHun opmars bleef niet onopgemerkt: 1000mods stond zij aan zij met namen als The Black Keys, Mastodon, The Black Angels en Graveyard. Op gerenommeerde festivals als Hellfest, Resurrection Fest, Desertfest, Rockwave Festival en Freak Valley Festival bewezen ze keer op keer dat hun allesverzengende energie geen grenzen kent.\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"d4e4f233-b424-4cf8-8421-bde79d60ce2f","header":{"title":"Tijdschema"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003e19:30 uur: deuren open\u003cbr\u003e20:00 uur: show Grim Rhythm\u003cbr\u003e20:45 uur: show Frenzee\u003cbr\u003e21:50 uur: show 1000mods\u003cbr\u003e23:10 uur: verwachte eindtijd\u003cbr\u003e(tijden zijn onder voorbehoud)\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"b42edd08-3481-4351-988a-6455718d509e","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FHXggFwnVuw?si=vpAQIFognEuALTku\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"e1840804-09aa-4db8-9f40-45f957073605","header":{"title":"Support: Frenzee"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDeze band kan je als het ware wel een familieband noemen. Het bestaat namelijk uit twee broers en een zus! Frenzee is een felle, energieke punkband gevestigd op het Griekse eiland Kreta. Van AC/DC en Nirvana tot The Prodigy en Bikini Kill, de explosieve sound van Frenzee is een bewijs van diepgewortelde passie voor het genre. Met deze band komt het podium tot leven met meedogenloze intensiteit en pure punkspirit.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"frenzee square","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=52fTQhiV","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=cIwJHHFY","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=dM-sR4AV","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=lDp8CFAY","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=q8ZF2RIU","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=rky35e6-"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=52fTQhiV 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=cIwJHHFY 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=dM-sR4AV 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=lDp8CFAY 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=q8ZF2RIU 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-04/frenzee%20square.jpg?itok=rky35e6- 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"935ca11c-25a6-4b7c-8829-a2a5f766ad4a","header":{"title":"Support: Grim Rhythm"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eBij Grim Rhythm is geen zanger nodig als de gitaren woedend en levendig klinken. Dit is dé smerige religie voor iedereen die van rauwe, luide rock zonder opvulling houdt. Van die muziek waarbij je buren de politie bellen en je vrienden headbangen in de moshpit. Grim Rhythm komt niet om aardig te zijn…\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"grim rhythm square","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=vlfzDSwl","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=a0hRlOVx","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=AcThV4LH","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=nPDXAvyx","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=uNHlyKnW","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=MJi_QaOh"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=vlfzDSwl 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=a0hRlOVx 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=AcThV4LH 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=nPDXAvyx 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=uNHlyKnW 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-04/grim%20rhythm%20square.jpg?itok=MJi_QaOh 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724594385,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-1000mods-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-1000mods-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":1756,"slug":"/agenda/scouting-girls","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/scouting-girls","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/scouting-girls","en":null},"title":"Scouting For Girls","content":"\u003cp\u003eHits als 'This Ain’t a Love Song', 'She’s So Lovely' en 'Elvis Ain’t Dead', een uitverkochte show in Wembley, vier Brit Award-nominaties en meer dan 1 miljard streams: we hebben het natuurlijk over Scouting For Girls. Deze Britse indiepopband brak in 2007 door met hun zelfgetitelde debuut, samen met jaren-2000-bands als McFly, Razorlight en Kaiser Chiefs. Hoewel ze al een tijdje meedraaien, klinkt hun muziek nog steeds even fris en aanstekelijk als bij die eerste platen.\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Scouting For Girls in Effenaar","description":"In oktober komt Scouting For Girls naar de Effenaar om hun gloednieuwe album genaamd ‘These Are The Good Days’ te presenteren in de Grote Zaal.","image":{"image":{"alt":"Scouting For Girls header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-01/2026-10-02%20Scouting%20For%20Girls%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_0.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-01/2026-10-02%20Scouting%20For%20Girls%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_0.jpg?itok=w9QQ8Sv4","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-01/2026-10-02%20Scouting%20For%20Girls%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_0.jpg?itok=YIpisX73","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-01/2026-10-02%20Scouting%20For%20Girls%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_0.jpg?itok=kx7LIBp0","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-01/2026-10-02%20Scouting%20For%20Girls%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_0.jpg?itok=SBwXAfGx","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-01/2026-10-02%20Scouting%20For%20Girls%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_0.jpg?itok=dyMJZWBX","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-01/2026-10-02%20Scouting%20For%20Girls%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_0.jpg?itok=nvmYwUa