ombino","content":"\u003cp\u003eBombino, geboren als Omara Moctar in 1980 in Niger, is een Desert Blues gitarist en zanger die bekend staat om zijn unieke mix van rock, psychedelica en reggae. Zijn muziek eert de Sahara, de regio waar hij vandaan komt en is opgegroeid. Vorig jaar sloot hij Bridge Around Town af op het Wilhelminaplein, waar het publiek goed uit hun dak ging!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTijdschema\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e19:30 Deuren open\u003cbr\u003e20:00 - 20:40 Ras Dashan\u003cbr\u003e21:00 - 22:30 Bombino\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(tijden onder voorbehoud) \u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Bombino","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1739460381,"machine":"2025-02-13T15:26:21+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Bombino ","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-02/Bombino%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/Bombino%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=jQBF-UUD","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/Bombino%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=cVnkd_2W","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-02/Bombino%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=rBqquw4q","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-02/Bombino%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=XzPrkxWh","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-02/Bombino%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=73j1lLrW","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-02/Bombino%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=pSUQFfTr"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/Bombino%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=jQBF-UUD 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/Bombino%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=cVnkd_2W 1920w","