et misschien anders vermoeden, maar de muziek van As December Falls klinkt allesbehalve koud. Met een onvermoeibare energie mengen ze stevige gitaarpartijen, catchy melodieën en diepgaande teksten tot een poppunk geluid geïnspireerd door de vroege jaren 2000, maar dan net iets edgier en gepolijst. Het resultaat: anthems die niet zouden misstaan op zonovergoten festivalweides.\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"As December Falls","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1744012500,"machine":"2025-04-07T07:55:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"As December Falls header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=gSsz_zW6","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=AYo0ew8n","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=OhhMzDfi","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=ueLki-_6","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=i6hqNvJY","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=6SRjjXmg"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=gSsz_zW6 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=AYo0ew8n 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=OhhMzDfi 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=ueLki-_6 320w","h