03eLet op: de show van Panda Bear op woensdag 5 november is helaas geannuleerd. Ticketkopers hebben een mail ontvangen met verdere informatie over de restitutie van hun ticket. Je hoeft hiervoor geen verdere actie te ondernemen.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLees hier het statement van de artiest:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\"Due to unforeseen circumstances Panda Bear is unable to perform at Effenaar. We appreciate your understanding and we hope to make it up to you soon.\"\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Panda Bear","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1748858364,"machine":"2025-06-02T09:59:24+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Panda Bear header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=Eo8ClnBT","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=HOqmU09m","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=h5KQO9eQ","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=y3Lj2D9-","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=6ndejJ4B","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=7s8qVNm9"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=Eo8ClnBT 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website_2.jpg?itok=HOqmU09m 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-