dzame intensiteit over alles wat wringt in de wereld: kapitalisme, sociale ongelijkheid en politieke onverschilligheid, om er een paar te noemen. Maar net zo goed over persoonlijke thema’s als genderidentiteit en mentale gezondheid. Met messcherpe teksten en een indringende \u003cem\u003edelivery\u003c/em\u003e zijn tranen nooit ver weg, en raast het kippenvel binnen de kortste keren over je lijf.\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Kae Tempest","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1746694500,"machine":"2025-05-08T08:55:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Kae Tempest header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/Kae%20Tempest%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/Kae%20Tempest%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=yHckn-bl","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/Kae%20Tempest%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=RGdpmmKV","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/Kae%20Tempest%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=kL9C2fAv","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/Kae%20Tempest%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=OfgnNKXV","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/Kae%20Tempest%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=MafjbbJx","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/Kae%20Tempest%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=HQ4urdtu"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/Kae%20Tempest%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=yHckn-bl 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/Kae%20Tempest%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=RGdpmmKV 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/Kae%20Tempest%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=kL9C2fAv 2510w","http