"uri":"https://www.ticketmaster.nl/event/1836282796?CAMEFROM=EFFENAAR\u0026brand=nl_effenaar","title":"","options":{"url":"https://www.ticketmaster.nl/event/1836282796?CAMEFROM=EFFENAAR\u0026brand=nl_effenaar"}},"ticket_price":"33.50","state":null,"locker_reservation":false,"restaurant_reservation":true,"related_events":[]},{"type":"event","nid":1354,"slug":"/agenda/frankie-and-witch-fingers","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/frankie-and-witch-fingers","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/frankie-and-witch-fingers","en":null},"title":"Frankie and the Witch Fingers","content":"\u003cp\u003eAls je je oren afstemt op de barsten in de San Andreas en luistert naar het gorgelende gekraak van de wereld, kom je misschien dicht in de buurt van het aardverschuivende onweer dat de afgelopen jaren uit L.A. is komen rollen onder de naam Frankie and the Witch Fingers. Deze psychpunk-band was eerder het hoogtepunt van festivals als Fuzz Club of Misty Fields, en zag je naast acts als Kikagaku Moyo, Ty Segall, Osees, Cheap Trick en ZZ Top.\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Frankie and the Witch Fingers","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1740560100,"machine":"2025-02-26T08:55:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Frankie","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-09/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitefrankie.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-09/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitefrankie.png?itok=mjgHIy-c","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-09/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitefrankie.png?itok=KFGa_yXe","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-09/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitefrankie.png?itok=DiQiF1JQ","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-09/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Websitefrankie.png?itok=5OR8CdDW","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-09/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Web