%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=3DTeFfiU","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=jnERAwSI","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=53ZPzPLd","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=mSGXhcmX","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=ENhTv3bO"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=wQV3Amn3 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=3DTeFfiU 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=jnERAwSI 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=53ZPzPLd 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=mSGXhcmX 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyBLOF.png?itok=ENhTv3bO 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"locations":[{"id":116,"title":"Grote zaal","is_external":false}],"state":"sold_out","club_card_event":false,"colors":{"accent_color":"#dce0da","background_color":"#485b6d","text_color":"#FFFFFF"}}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"e9a58f60-6125-4b6a-b82b-58cffe0195b5","header":{"title":"Duurzaamheid"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eMet het oog op duurzaamheid, verzoeken wij zoveel mogelijk gasten met de fiets te komen. Ook wordt er gebruik gemaakt van hardcups, om wegwerpplastic tegen te gaan. Wat consumpties betreft: wij zorgen voor genoeg eet- en drinkkraampjes, dus bespaar jezelf gesjouw en dompel je onder in het lokale eet- en drinkaanbod van 't Wasven.\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"a760ea5b-64f1-4254-a999-6f56a10bf37c","header":{"title":"14:00-14:30 Mazis"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDe gevoelige liedjes van Mazis gaan over liefde en hoe je plek te vinden in de wereld. Nadat hij gevangen heeft gezeten in Iran, vluchtte hij voor de vrijheid naar Nederland. De inspirerende singer-songwriter weet in zijn nummers de universele zoektocht van licht naar donker te weerspiegelen.\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"285299b9-2a77-47d6-971e-f502984feee8","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lRaRlzeCbQE?si=PwBCyn6_ENHfP2yh\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"6d00b36a-6838-4270-984f-8b778e915982","header":{"title":"15:00-15:45 Mama's Shakin' Beanbags"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eIn de sound van Mara Mandeau hoor je invloeden van Adele, Aretha Franklin en Amy Winehouse, die een uniek tintje krijgen door haar Syrische roots.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"12afd08b-45cc-48ed-8221-c4365473e393","header":{"title":"16:15-17:15 Timo de Jong \u0026 Leadbeaters"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eTimo\u0026nbsp;de Jong maakt muziek geïnspireerd door de jaren zestig, maar dan in een eigentijds en verfijnd jasje gestoken. Zijn diepe, warme zangstem doet denken aan befaamde crooners als Glen Campbell en Frank Sinatra. Hij slaat de handen ineen met Leadbeaters, die met\u0026nbsp;akoestische instrumenten als fiddle, gitaar, mandoline en contrabas en meerstemmige zang een folky en punky mixed grill van Amerikaanse traditionals, old-time, rhythm \u0026amp; blues, bluegrass, cajun en gospel creëren.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"timo leadbeaters","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=mdNwXDDN","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=sXtaiT1P","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=FU3r2ZBa","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=XVlzem0i","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=sZxUXKcf","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=4vxQzaaJ"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=mdNwXDDN 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=sXtaiT1P 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=FU3r2ZBa 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=XVlzem0i 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=sZxUXKcf 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/Timo%20de%20Jong%20%2B%20Leadbeaters.jpeg?itok=4vxQzaaJ 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"834b0cad-a44e-4dd4-bd5b-3abfd190b271","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6vrspbqRSU8?si=piclIAhJHWAZM_ED\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724601160,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-wasven24aug-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-wasven24aug-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":1428,"slug":"/agenda/hit-city-2025-zaterdag","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/hit-city-2025-zaterdag","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/hit-city-2025-zaterdag","en":null},"title":"Hit The City 2025 | zaterdag ","content":"\u003cp\u003eHit The City festival trapt af met een nieuwe editie! Met vier dagen vol live-acts, binnen- en buitenlocaties door de hele stad, en een levendig dag- en nachtprogramma. Van gitaarbands tot pop, hiphop, DJ’s - en alles daartussenin. Hit The City is een laagdrempelige manier om muziek te ontdekken, je favoriete acts te zien en andere muziekliefhebbers te ontmoeten. Geen tickets of festivalpas nodig. Tot donderdag 28, vrijdag 29, zaterdag 30 en zondag 31 augustus!\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Ronnie Flex \u0026 The Fam, Superstrings, Blanks, Maan en meer op zaterdag tijdens Hit The City!","description":"Hit The City festival keert terug. Met binnen- en buitenlocaties door de hele stad, een divers dag- en nachtprogramma en een line-up die zal bestaan uit live-acts. Van gitaarbands tot pop, hiphop, DJ’s en alles daartussenin. Hit The City is een laagdrempelige manier om muziek te ontdekken, je favoriete acts te zien en andere muziekliefhebbers te ontmoeten. Geen tickets of festivalpas nodig. Tot donderdag 28, vrijdag 29, zaterdag 30 en zondag 31 augustus!","image":{"image":{"alt":"Hit The City announce 1 ","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=Whf9jmDO","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=T_qbKQkk","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=X0IdoxIv","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=Je3YGuJQ","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=APyKO9Ig","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=54piEm7z"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=Whf9jmDO 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=T_qbKQkk 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=X0IdoxIv 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=Je3YGuJQ 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=APyKO9Ig 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-04/HTC%20Wide.png?itok=54piEm7z 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null}},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1744802806,"machine":"2025-04-16T11:26:46+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Ronnie Flex ","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-04/1920%20x%201080%20Ronnie%20Flex%20%26%20The%20Fam.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-04/1920%20x%201080%20Ronnie%20Flex%20%26%20The%20Fam.png?itok=iLHLi4q8","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfr