_","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/4.png?itok=e-1HB-P-"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/4.png?itok=gV_UU83r 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/4.png?itok=yAxRcuJF 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/4.png?itok=NvYRXKLc 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/4.png?itok=J-QDrwaB 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/4.png?itok=aCMaWfm_ 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/4.png?itok=e-1HB-P- 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"35dcda00-80fd-4082-9bf4-e5f75ed8af11","header":{"title":"Embodiment of Sadism"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDeze brutal death metal band haalt hun inspiratie van act als Dying Fetus, Suffocation, Cannibal Corpse en Sanguisugabogg. Ze combineren death metal en slam, waarmee ze een hele eigen interpetatie laten horen van extreme muziek. Een geluid die je niet snel zult vergeten.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"Embodiment of Sadism","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/7.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=jYIs-Ule","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=39nHZE1Z","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=YurqML5h","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=BtELNzn5","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=Ubzpw7Hd","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=EGm8H5wu"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=jYIs-Ule 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=39nHZE1Z 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=YurqML5h 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=BtELNzn5 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=Ubzpw7Hd 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/7.png?itok=EGm8H5wu 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"ea33ba1f-3f5c-499b-8613-0a6cdbac689d","header":{"title":"Visceral Contempt"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDeze band maakt metalcore op de oude vertrouwde manier. De EP wordt in het einde van het jaar opgenomen, maar de gereleasde tracks beloven veel goeds... en hards! Er worden nieuwe nummers geschreven in de stijl van Ringworm, Kickback en All Out War. Verwacht harde en groovy old-school metalcore.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"Visceral contempt","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/5.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=0lv3aeeB","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=J9_82nyR","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=BbtP8ID7","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=yR664zVY","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=QgLYwle1","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=XzFLh4K_"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=0lv3aeeB 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=J9_82nyR 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=BbtP8ID7 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=yR664zVY 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=QgLYwle1 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/5.png?itok=XzFLh4K_ 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"4ce1d054-c900-4dcc-8a20-0f52464d374d","header":{"title":"HAATDRAGER"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eHAATDRAGER is een 7-delige zware sludge outfit met elementen uit underground hip-hop en electronische muziek. Ze halen inspiratie uit als als LLNN, Indian en BACKXWASH. In het Nederlands gieten lyrics scrijvers en bandleden Roos en Jeroen hun ziel en emoties in hun lyrics. Deze band wordt ook wel omschreven als een artistieke sloopkogel. Ze vertalen wanhoop en afkeer vanuit zowel het perspectief van het onderwerp als de toeschouwer en plaatsen deze in een betoverende artistieke uiting - om zo bevrijding en heling te bevorderen, stamp voor stamp.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"Haatdrager square","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/6.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=diGek7uO","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=7pPvV0d7","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=t0YnbA8t","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=GOpF42og","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=hm6SINCx","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=-oiORvO1"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=diGek7uO 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=7pPvV0d7 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=t0YnbA8t 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=GOpF42og 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/6.png?itok=hm6SINCx 480w","https://d12y285