eader":{"title":"Bekijk hier de aftermovie!","description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oDJb3NfIfns?si=9AFUfsQ6RuLLrA74\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"effenaar_image","id":"b0446ffa-bc51-4f73-a5d9-e1b5da9ba54f","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"image":{"image":{"alt":"caya tt","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=pfbRMKQM","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=yASLAN6p","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=F3H2Wvw0","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=lp2jFU3c","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=F2cbpTCf","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=xq02NUdx"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=pfbRMKQM 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=yASLAN6p 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=F3H2Wvw0 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=lp2jFU3c 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=F2cbpTCf 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-09/CAYA%20Narrowcast.png?itok=xq02NUdx 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"is_fullscreen":false}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"71d745ea-5020-4eb6-ae91-0259e589f251","header":{"title":"Foodtrucks en tv-schermen"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eOp ons buitenterrein zijn er ook dit jaar weer foodtrucks aanwezig. Je bent van harte welkom voor een hapje en drankje bij \u003ca href=\"https://www.twinsfoodtruck.be/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.twinsfoodtruck.be/\"\u003eTwins foodtruck\u003c/a\u003e en \u003ca href=\"https://bastapizza.nl/#home\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://bastapizza.nl/#home\"\u003eBasta Pizza\u003c/a\u003e! Beide keukens hebben ook vega-opties.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOok zorgen we voor tv-schermen op verschillende plekken (zowel binnen als buiten) waarop alle bands uit de Kleine Zaal live te horen en zien zijn.\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"cdc63282-758f-45af-8527-69379efbf1fe","header":{"title":"K's Choice plays 'Paradise In Me'"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eVoor een exclusieve NL show komt K’s Choice de 30-jarige verjaardag van het bijzonder succesvolle album ‘Paradise In Me’ met ons vieren! Ze zullen de plaat integraal komen spelen, wat het extra bijzonder maakt. De volledige band zal on stage verschijnen en als extraatje brengen ze ook wat bonus songs ten gehore. Maak je klaar om mee te zingen met klassiekers als Not An Addict, Mr. Freeze \u0026amp; A Sound That Only You Can Hear!\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"kschoice","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=htc2T2OA","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=aA2PHj3p","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=grtxwsFx","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=VRT3Jhh6","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=E0ajZWNl","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=mz8XWsb2"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=htc2T2OA 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=aA2PHj3p 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=grtxwsFx 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=VRT3Jhh6 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=E0ajZWNl 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/KsChoice_2025_03.jpeg?itok=mz8XWsb2 720w"]},"source":"Foto: Frank Clauwers","source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"2019079b-aa8f-4f11-ba2b-d2d13dc710ad","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aBWq6eHKjwk?si=T2f-ezRsHuCiZUDj\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"8f64f202-8fc6-42af-988a-908fa217ef01","header":{"title":"Fun Lovin' Criminals"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDeze in NYC opgerichte band heeft zich door de jaren heen bewezen als een live-act die je gezien moét hebben. Je zou ze kunnen kennen van hun klassiekers 'Scooby Snacks': de smash hit met dialogen uit de film van Quentin Tarantino en 'Love Unlimited': een eerbetoon aan Barry White. In hun unieke sound weten ze invloeden uit rock, funk, blues, jazz, disco en hiphop te fuseren en weten ze wereldwijd fans mee te trekken in hun magnetische en charmante wereld.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"flc","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=MGCGULws","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=e5RSAvh6","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=43DZhX_n","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=IyVaQZaj","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=2Vavjk4T","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=uMZdtnpn"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=MGCGULws 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=e5RSAvh6 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=43DZhX_n 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=IyVaQZaj 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=2Vavjk4T 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/FLC%20SINATRA.jpeg?itok=uMZdtnpn 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"faf08ccd-151b-4310-a053-d21ad6ba6bf6","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HEMjF2n3-SQ?si=5QWJ1JiShbrXrv2p\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"6d0842d2-0e83-4305-8d2a-4c5657192feb","header":{"title":"Claw Boys Claw"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eSamen met gitarist John Cameron vormt frontman Peter te Bos al sinds 1983 de harde kern van Claw Boys Claw. In 2023 bewezen ze op ons podium (ook tijdens Come As You Are) dat ze met hun opwindende mix van punk, rock, blues en rockabilly nog altijd de rauwe Amsterdamse rockmentaliteit voltreffend onder de knie hebben. Tijd om het nog eens dunnetjes over te komen doen in een nieuwe show!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"cbc","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=qBJmsr99","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=iYC4yijU","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=NdVGjhg1","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=Hs-cPtc4","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=NM32tIj1","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=DLXHwbWh"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=qBJmsr99 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=iYC4yijU 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=NdVGjhg1 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=Hs-cPtc4 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=NM32tIj1 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/CBC-KITE_2021-1-scaled-1.jpg?itok=DLXHwbWh 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"6d1c4912-f293-4000-8ca6-62348f7a2b68","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yti6slfqcOU?si=zw2TkNEzWnXfo39n\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"85149576-5a45-4bca-aaf1-ee7de536f496","header":{"title":"Jools"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDe punkrock van Jools is een overweldigende ervaring, zowel op het podium als op plaat. Ze staan voor vrijheid van geluid wat zich uit in een ongefilterde expressie van en zoektocht naar waarheid, met daaronder een tikkeltje opzwepende woede. \u0026nbsp;Of het nu een klap in het gezicht of een kus op de wang is, Jools is niets minder dan een band om in te geloven.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"joolss","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=QXBuBwKz","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=aP_OQGpx","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=eH7YmNR_","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=HoF2VkZy","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=gk_om0FY","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=wpL_6R8O"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=QXBuBwKz 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=aP_OQGpx 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=eH7YmNR_ 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=HoF2VkZy 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=gk_om0FY 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/Jools-Nov-24-%28Connor-McBriarty%29.jpg?itok=wpL_6R8O 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"552df67e-2857-4b14-a305-1ec4559d07a8","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cwTSHicwAZE?si=97g2gN-mqQKUsssY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"3b396be2-57f9-4adb-8a0e-43572c4cd19d","header":{"title":"Metal Molly"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDit jaar markeert het 30-jarig jubileum van debuutplaat 'Surgery for Zebra', waarop de Belpop classic 'Orange' te horen is. Na een aantal indrukwekkende carrière highlights, waaronder de support verzorgen voor niemand minder dan David Bowie \u0026amp; Therapy? en shows op Werchter (1996 en 2000), Pinkpop en Lowlands kijken wij reikhalzend uit naar hun bezoekje aan onze zaal. Met dezelfde energie als in the good old days!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"mm","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=Q9saSmAE","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=0Z-FbLg0","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=aCc0kw5I","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=gcOCPaDo","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=g3nzxFD8","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=VqamXvkI"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=Q9saSmAE 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=0Z-FbLg0 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=aCc0kw5I 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=gcOCPaDo 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=g3nzxFD8 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/metalmolly.jpg?itok=VqamXvkI 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"161ce14d-fdcd-43e9-8c02-a2dd4428d360","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sCoa-TtBBH0?si=IFdgq3f5Sd_ubnVk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"25e48f2f-1d6b-4270-88e6-03f0cea9e56a","header":{"title":"Terrorvision"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDe in Bradford opgerichte band Terrorvision brak in de jaren 90 door in de rockscene met hun debuutplaat ‘Formaldehyde’, waarna ze de samenwerking aan gingen met producer Gil Norton. Na meerdere plekken in verschillende hitlijsten en een break van een paar jaar, waren ze in 2024 weer terug met ‘WE ARE NOT ROBOTS!’, een plaat vol glimmende pophooks en in-your-face hardrock.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"terrorvision","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=mQCJuo8y","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=MNiwpS6r","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=pwFkz6cM","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=COd5pD6y","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=SYMPptrz","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=lH5gMNdg"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=mQCJuo8y 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=MNiwpS6r 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=pwFkz6cM 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=COd5pD6y 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=SYMPptrz 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/TERRORVISION%202.jpeg?itok=lH5gMNdg 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"457e1e6e-58f5-4b04-8520-52cfe8b11098","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2_HObyWr_5s?si=k26l-TWoFugk5Efc\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"7559b206-42f4-436c-95d0-5dcba3e478d1","header":{"title":"High Hi"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong Fling is helaas genoodzaakt om hun optreden af te zeggen. Maar we hebben een waardige vervanger gevonden: High Hi! \u003c/strong\u003eDit Antwerpse drietal heeft een eigen plek gecreëerd waar experiment en scherpe popgevoeligheid perfect samengaan. Waar het begon met een dromerige, door shoegaze geïnspireerde stijl, ontwikkelde de sound zich gaandeweg tot een subtiele balans tussen introspectie en hooks.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"high hi","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=eCpmWGXF","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=bQLdZZd_","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=CIpd2-mE","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=pJrF23Qe","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=kmKwPnWw","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=40m1y7Pf"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=eCpmWGXF 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=bQLdZZd_ 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=CIpd2-mE 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=pJrF23Qe 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=kmKwPnWw 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-07/Square%20A.jpg?itok=40m1y7Pf 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"eda47798-8b85-4769-abd0-cd264977a0cc","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dEM8IkCMb9U?si=e00mmHs7O4VY7oyR\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"22a218af-0bd0-434e-99a0-77bf556ae9ba","header":{"title":"Afterpartees"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eHet vrolijkste powerpop-exportproduct uit zonnig Limburg ligt met hun poppy sound ergens tussen Blondie, Parquet Courts en Jonathan Richman. Met stuiterende energie hebben ze de festivalweides van o.a. Pinkpop, Best Kept Secret en Lowlands al onveilig gemaakt en dit jaar markeert hun 12,5-jarig bestaan als band. Samen muziek maken vinden ze nog steeds het leukste wat er is en dat hoor je dan ook terug in de eerste singles van aankomende EP 'Higher Places', gekenmerkt door de unieke Afterpartees sound.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"afterpartees","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=8cIhIEtO","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=Ac3rSeT_","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=KKEjJqs8","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=A4i_AbME","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=a1Ny8nOD","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=Sj5HmVd_"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=8cIhIEtO 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=Ac3rSeT_ 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=KKEjJqs8 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=A4i_AbME 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=a1Ny8nOD 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/portrait_AFTERPARTEES_higherplaces_small.jpg?itok=Sj5HmVd_ 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"22d46221-174f-46a7-99c6-be9c5587d4bc","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mZcPFSQ_ikI?si=Ns-WrUYaxjXV3BlL\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"30fd050b-e1f5-43f4-ab84-54c4304e9899","header":{"title":"Skating Polly"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDe ongebreidelde vrijheid van punk perfect weten te belichamen: laat dat maar aan Skating Polly over. Met hun eclectische mix van riot grrrl, grunge, punkrock en indiepop staat het gezelschap bekend om poëtische teksten, intense live-energie en melodieuze arrangementen. Vorig jaar speelden ze een strakke show in het Stroomhuis, dit jaar komen ze knallen op CAYA!\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"skating polly","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-03/sp.jpeg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=PH47UsHN","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=ykkqyqXA","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=Ipx68m1o","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=9_xPG0i7","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=045nDTOU","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=Ke4kQSY7"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=PH47UsHN 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=ykkqyqXA 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=Ipx68m1o 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=9_xPG0i7 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=045nDTOU 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/sp.jpeg?itok=Ke4kQSY7 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"f11e87a0-67ab-4015-b767-c377a52848c2","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0B4Nn9_9YHg?si=n0KTicVly2Tao2Ad\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"dcdd6f11-4c9b-455c-bbe3-f1cf87ad3f65","header":{"title":"Teen Creeps"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDit Gentse trio weet de alternatieve rocksound uit de jaren 90 een nieuw leven in te blazen. Met een sound die doet denken aan bands als Dinosaur Jr. en Jawbreaker kun je je klaarstomen voor fuzzy gitaren, energieke drums en een stemgeluid die recht uit het hart komt. Dit jaar verschijnt een nieuwe plaat, waarop de band de sound verder uitdiept en verder verfijnt.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"tc","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=HL_9y1KL","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=6sUz6QMq","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=cSe2BXrw","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=HIrJfqDP","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=xKsppqDQ","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=-btkuAjy"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=HL_9y1KL 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=6sUz6QMq 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=cSe2BXrw 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=HIrJfqDP 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=xKsppqDQ 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-03/Teen-Creeps-Daniil-Lavrovski%20%281%29.jpg?itok=-btkuAjy 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"61d79697-8565-455b-89a2-69ff254e025d","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9ag4QM6SFZQ?si=eRB3jwKcg6DEqpZW\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"db2283de-a31d-4a3c-b1b0-320fb9917899","header":{"title":"OVERSIZE"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDeze altrockers uit het Zuid-Westen van het Verenigd Koninkrijk bewegen zich tussen shoegaze, post-hardcore, en fuzz, waarbij de liefde voor alternatieve muziek uit de 90’s goed hoorbaar is. Eerder deelden ze de stage al met o.a. Militarie Gun, Fiddlehead, Higher Power en Static Dress.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"oversize","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=XpOIdwg4","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=XJCX7ru8","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=cZgGAjfN","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=8xV4Zj97","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=GcGYmdTr","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=xRvCVKHi"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=XpOIdwg4 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=XJCX7ru8 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=cZgGAjfN 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=8xV4Zj97 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=GcGYmdTr 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/DSC08684.jpeg?itok=xRvCVKHi 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"b1a08428-f2dd-4fe7-a36c-d693c44ac1a0","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Dp-aNIBMufg?si=zjB0_q4zJRyVi5Ty\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"6cd15523-030c-4f36-8d30-f9d6dad53532","header":{"title":"Fit"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDeze Utrechters brengen een explosieve mix van post-punk, shoegaze en hiphop. In een eigenzinnige show weten ze met hun aanstekelijke energie iedere zaal om te toveren in een dansende menigte. Voordat ze Eindhoven komen veroveren, mogen ze de support verzorgen voor The Prodigy in het Spoorpark in Tilburg.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"fit","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=MoHKNFbf","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=eYoJrlaI","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=w8OUWwqu","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=IAH-XC9S","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=1ZOlvu5M","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=9j9WMj-w"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=MoHKNFbf 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=eYoJrlaI 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=w8OUWwqu 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=IAH-XC9S 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=1ZOlvu5M 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/Fit%20Foto%20Main.jpg?itok=9j9WMj-w 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"0de93b0e-76f0-48b3-ac24-1884d47f07a3","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe style=\"border-radius:12px\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/artist/5g5saPpzD7SlWFFLQXA0Mf?utm_source=generator\" width=\"100%\" height=\"352\" frameBorder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724603738,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-caya2025-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-caya2025-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":1836,"slug":"/agenda/isolated","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/isolated","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/isolated","en":null},"title":"Isolated","content":"\u003cp\u003eIsolated komt voor het eerst naar Effenaar met een avond gewijd aan de ruwe essentie van Schranz en Industrial Hard Techno. Een intieme boilerroom setting, een heavy atmosfeer en compromisloos geluid gaat de nacht vormen met pure intensiteit.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVoel de muziek, verlies jezelf in de energie en wordt onderdeel van een menigte die van begin tot einde in het moment zit. Met internationale debutanten, de terugkeer van een hard techno legende en een streng no-phone beleid is deze nacht gebouwd om je helemaal onder te dompelen. Maak je klaar om in het moment te leven, \u003cem\u003eISOLATED \u003c/em\u003evan de buitenwereld.\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"ISOLATED | Effenaar","description":"Isolated komt voor het eerst naar Effenaar en brengt een immersieve experience mee vol Schranz en Hard Industrial Techno.","image":{"image":{"alt":"Isolated header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-03/_%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-03/_%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=4fIPnkeT","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-03/_%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=NdbhhV-7","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-03/_%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=OkORzoL8","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-03/_%E2%80%93%20192