fd5-7ee4-451d-9191-c65839a579af","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Brj0rlauyvM?si=XoIm758wZLM9rJJY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"4716c2e9-28ea-4432-868f-0a452c18b77c","header":{"title":"Support: Kleine Crack + Slagter"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eKleine Crack \u0026amp; Slagter de donker de duister uit anna (Antwerpen) uit het collectief VHS. Zij releasen onder het label Burning Fik van Faberyayo \u0026amp; Abel .Bezeten raps \u0026amp; beats en helse energie 6 staat zeer centraal maar is geen duivelaanbidder.\u003c/p\u003e","image":{"image":{"alt":"kleine crack + slagter","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=EFyMufk1","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=la-cG9j8","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=bvm4mdYO","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=Ie2NfPsp","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=KSQDvqy1","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=KqR2IAax"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=EFyMufk1 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=la-cG9j8 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=bvm4mdYO 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=Ie2NfPsp 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=KSQDvqy1 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-04/kleine%20crack%20%2B%20slagter.png?itok=KqR2IAax 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724605767,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-outerspass-9mei-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-outerspass-9mei-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":1685,"slug":"/agenda/dotan","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/dotan","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/dotan","en":null},"title":"Dotan","content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDeze show is uitverkocht! Wil je toch nog een ticket bemachtigen? \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://resale.ticketing.cm.com/en/c06da01b-0a59-45e5-86e3-bbbb747efc75\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHoud dan ons resale platform in de gaten\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e. \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNa vier veelgeprezen albums, internationale hits en wereldtournees heeft singer-songwriter Dotan geleerd om zowel het licht als de duisternis in zichzelf te omarmen. Door het idee los te laten van wie en waar hij dacht te moeten zijn, is zijn visie nog nooit zo helder geweest. En dat hoor je terug in zijn nieuwe werk: een ongefilterd portret van waar hij staat in het leven, zowel als artiest als als mens.\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Dotan","description":"Na vier veelgeprezen albums, internationale hits en wereldtournees heeft singer-songwriter Dotan geleerd om zowel het licht als de duisternis in zichzelf te omarmen. Door het idee los te laten van wie en waar hij dacht te moeten zijn, is zijn visie nog nooit zo helder geweest. En dat hoor je terug in zijn nieuwe werk: een ongefilterd portret van waar hij staat in het leven, zowel als artiest als als mens.","image":{"image":{"alt":"dotan header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=REzfmeTz","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=RbT3psUG","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=cZAUI8sb","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=yAVwPcP4","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=SXMrFPfn","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=TLmm05il"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=REzfmeTz 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=RbT3psUG 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=cZAUI8sb 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=yAVwPcP4 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website%20dotan.png?itok=SXMrFPfn 480w","htt