es"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eIn oktober 2025 verscheen Last Goodbyes: een nummer over het koesteren van herinneringen aan iemand of iets dat je leven heeft gevormd. In het nummer hoor je het warme, hymnische geluid wat Dotan zo eigen maakt, en toch voelt het fris en vernieuwend.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"effenaar_quote","id":"6295f402-d5c5-44b6-a591-72c0d2b8553a","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"quote":"Het wordt mijn vijfde album, maar het voelt meer als een tweede debuut.","author":"Dotan"}},{"type":"embed","id":"1581eed8-8086-44b3-841f-0bc454d48665","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VPk1yrGH3yM?si=sj1nxUgtfUph3qyn\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"embed","id":"f9c65e46-b283-4a72-855e-f6f28391845b","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe data-testid=\"embed-iframe\" style=\"border-radius:12px\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/artist/1cwOthlzLBwN8Imbq7P71H?utm_source=generator\" width=\"100%\" height=\"352\" frameBorder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":2,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724755563,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-dotan-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-dotan-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid"