 Night","subtitle":"Dansavond met Turkse popmuziek","slug":"/agenda/turkish-pop-night-24okt","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/turkish-pop-night-24okt","date":{"timestamp":1792800000,"machine":"2026-10-24"},"thumbnail_image":{"image":{"alt":"turkish pop night","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=Tdsk6aD7","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=nS29BMQd","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=lt3ZfQCK","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=WSBGu7Vz","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=IXLO9ado","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=waQNUMpd"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=Tdsk6aD7 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=nS29BMQd 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=lt3ZfQCK 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=WSBGu7Vz 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=IXLO9ado 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-04/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyTPN.png?itok=waQNUMpd 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"locations":[{"id":126,"title":"Kleine Zaal","is_external":false}],"state":null,"club_card_event":false,"colors":{"accent_color":"#000000","background_color":"#fc7356","text_color":"#000000"}}],"blocks":[{"type":"cta","id":"d45fb518-52f5-4c1a-9d4e-397ac3c218e4","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"cta_title":"Hit The City website","cta_description":null,"url":{"uri":"https://hitthecity-festival.nl/","title":"Bekijk de website van Hit The City voor meer info","options":{"url":"https://hitthecity-festival.nl/"}},"description":null,"title":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"16f5d913-b5d4-47eb-bb9b-b8baf7cea990","header":{"title":"Hit The City Opening Night"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eOp donderdag 19 oktober trappen we het begin van het festival af met een gratis toegankelijke avond in Effenaar. Op het programma: Nederlandse hip-hop legendes Sticks \u0026amp; sor. Op de vrijdag en zaterdag van Hit The City zijn er gratis toegankelijke shows verspreid over meer dan tien locaties in de binnenstad van Eindhoven.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"f35b6ec2-485b-4750-8f3e-d25318b7c7dd","header":{"title":"Timetable Sticks + sor | Hit The City openingsavond"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003e19:30 uur: Deuren open\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n20:00 uur: Show sor\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n21:15 uur: Show Sticks\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"Sticks + sor timetable","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=4mL3-UYG","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=_IFLoD6f","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=89WVmPEP","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=UaDDDBfT","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=zjdF2fT1","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=IIedtcbI"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=4mL3-UYG 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=_IFLoD6f 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=89WVmPEP 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=UaDDDBfT 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=zjdF2fT1 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-10/Sticks%20%26%20Sor%204-6%20TT%281%29.jpg?itok=IIedtcbI 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"4ddf8564-b115-4485-8792-bbf2c162d38d","header":{"title":"Sticks"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eSticks is een van de meest invloedrijke figuren in de Nederlandse hiphop. Meer dan vijftien jaar geleden brak hij door in de scene als een deel van Opgezwolle, samen met Rico en producer Delic. Albums zoals 'Spuugdingen op de mic', 'Vloeistof' en 'Eigen Wereld' zijn inmiddels echte hiphopklassiekers. Misschien ken je hem ook van samenwerkingen met verschillende artiesten zoals Winne, Jiggy Djé, Wu-Tang Clan-producer Dr. Moon, Typhoon, A.R.T. en Zwangere Guy. Hij bracht onlangs het nieuwe album 'Alles Over Hoop' uit, wat misschien wel een hint is naar zijn aanstaande optreden op Hit The City. Feest gegarandeerd.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"Sticks","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-09/sticks%20.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=JCihKS9z","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=VfbHrjaW","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=U4PbhsC3","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=Hglj7Hzm","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=F-z74A4u","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=OqliKFWM"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=JCihKS9z 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=VfbHrjaW 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=U4PbhsC3 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=Hglj7Hzm 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=F-z74A4u 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-09/sticks%20.png?itok=OqliKFWM 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"80bce16e-461d-417c-9e75-52a551764bfd","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ejd13R07qFU?si=REK2o8VUkgJSrrV2\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"d503a9d1-68ea-44ea-b565-4d7cc6404aed","header":{"title":"Sor"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eEen moshpit op vioolmuziek? Het is niet ondenkbaar met Sor, een van de meest veelbelovende en unieke artiesten in de Nederlandse hiphopscene. Deze Amsterdamse alleskunner (rapper, producer, componist) combineert klassieke muziek met invloeden uit drill en trap, begeleid door een heel orkest. Onlangs won hij een dirigentenwedstrijd in tv-programma Maestro, behaalde hij miljoenen streams met zijn project Bae Doven. Ook is hij een prominent lid van Black Acid en tekende hij bij Noah's Ark. Dit alles ondanks zijn ernstige gehoorverlies, wat hem dwong nog creatiever te werken. Op Hit The City brengt hij een indrukwekkende mix van stijlen begeleid door een strijkkwartet.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"Sor","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-09/sor%20.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=NT72DDOS","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=vMtarf2D","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=jYkzdk-P","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=cKmgg5AY","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=XwMg7efU","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=fFL3fgL6"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=NT72DDOS 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=vMtarf2D 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=jYkzdk-P 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=cKmgg5AY 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=XwMg7efU 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-09/sor%20.png?itok=fFL3fgL6 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"cae0031f-569d-4996-99ba-4974ef444155","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/t1D_GE934mo?si=ucoYajvTVhHHmYjo\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"9ee336f6-532e-4634-adf4-a5c6fac7e6e4","header":{"title":"Line-up vrijdag 20 en zaterdag 21 oktober"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAlex Vargas - Amartey - Amina - Anna-Rose Clayton - Bad Breeding - Beige Banquet - Big Special - Brokezart - Cosmic Crooner - DeathbyRomy - Deijuvhs - Denzel Himself - DITZ - DjeuhDjoah \u0026amp; Lieutenant Nicholson - Droom Dit -\u0026nbsp; Girl Scout - Guusje - Hak Baker - Hammok - Jimmy Whispers Kleine Crack \u0026amp; Slagter\u0026nbsp; - Lander \u0026amp; Adriaan - Library Card - LIONSTORM - Loupe - Lusho - M. Lucky - Mariposa - Naaz - Neighbours Burning Neighbours - Nusantara Beat - Porcelain id - Reanny - Sababa 5 - Siggy \u0026amp; D1ns - Sophie Faith - THAMES - The Indien - The Joy Hotel - The People’s Pleasure Grounds - Yaro Mila - Yung Dada + many more TBA\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"cta","id":"29b28db2-a1d9-4762-b412-bb1cb5834337","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"cta_title":null,"cta_description":null,"url":{"uri":"https://www.instagram.com/hitthecity.festival/","title":"Volg Hit The City op Instagram","options":{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/hitthecity.festival/"}},"description":null,"title":null}},{"type":"related_event","id":"10eebd47-e614-4f57-baf0-00f428acf09a","header":{"title":"Hit The City 2023","description":null},"content":{"items":[{"type":"event","nid":565,"slug":"/agenda/hit-city-2023-opening-sticks-sor","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/hit-city-2023-opening-sticks-sor","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/hit-city-2023-opening-sticks-sor","en":null},"title":"Hit The City 2023 Opening: Sticks \u0026 Sor","content":"\u003cp\u003eHit The City is terug op 19-21 oktober! Net als voorgaande jaren trekken we de levendigheid van Dutch Design Week door naar de avond met een geheel gratis muziekfestival georganiseerd en geprogrammeerd door Effenaar en Friendly Fire.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003eOntdek drie dagen lang de nieuwste en meest veelbelovende acts, grensverleggende muziek en een diversiteit aan genres op meer dan tien bruisende locaties in Eindhoven.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"Hit The City 2023 Opening: Sticks \u0026 Sor","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1686578400,"machine":"2023-06-12T14:00:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"sticks sor","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=ZadaMYI8","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=HysMLNg5","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=BkvpC2co","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=axKNbeSr","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=LcAepgCK","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=vef_CXJw"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=ZadaMYI8 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=HysMLNg5 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=BkvpC2co 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=axKNbeSr 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-09/Naamloos-1.png?itok=LcAepgCK 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/style