ng?itok=s8mAB35S","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyreincarnated.png?itok=zG3CzQeh"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyreincarnated.png?itok=MTLj7liH 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyreincarnated.png?itok=ZNWSoLbz 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyreincarnated.png?itok=olBhwspC 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyreincarnated.png?itok=Ip65n2n6 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyreincarnated.png?itok=s8mAB35S 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-07/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyreincarnated.png?itok=zG3CzQeh 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"locations":[{"id":116,"title":"Grote zaal","is_external":false}],"state":"cancelled","club_card_event":false,"colors":{"accent_color":"#fd0000","background_color":"#1c0000","text_color":"#FFFFFF"}}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"ff6fb59d-a1cc-4dae-839c-eb95a7a6a6e9","header":{"title":null},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eJe jeugdherinneringen, je eerste liefde, de plek waar je bent opgegroeid, je dromen, je speelgoed. Maak je klaar voor een avond vol plezier en de grootste Turkse hits uit de jaren ’90 en 2000!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNeem je Nederlandse vrienden en familie mee en laat ons samen de melodieën delen van de dagen die ons hebben gevormd, toen en nu!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eLet op: Turkish Pop Night is 18+! Er kan aan de deur om ID worden gevraagd. Neem een identiteitsbewijs mee.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"eb637e92-78d2-491a-bbe2-3b192cab0229","header":{"title":"Türkçesi"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDj Denden ile Türkçe Pop Gecesi 4 Nisan Cumartesi akşamı Effenaar Eindhoven sahnesinde!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSokaklarda kumdan baraj yapanlar, tetriste en uzun çubugu sona bırakanlar, soba üstünde kestane yiyenler ve top kek sevenler.. Çocukluk anılarınız, ilk aşkınız, büyüdüğünüz yer, hayalleriniz, oyuncaklarınız... 90'larin ve 2000'lerin en guzel muzikleriyle eglenceli bir geceye hazir olun.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHollandali dostlarinizi, ailenizi de getirin hep birlikte dunu ve bugun bizi biz yapan gunlerimizin melodilerini paylasalim!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eDikkat: Turkish Pop Night 18 yaşından büyükler içindir! Kapıda kimlik sorulabilir.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"52b9ad1f-33e6-4e51-bb30-183535a93fbf","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/icZ-OlVSvb4?si=u3Zh8tgjWuJIl6jN\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":2,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724755384,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-turkish-pop-night-24okt-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-turkish-pop-night-24okt-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":567,"slug":"/agenda/hit-city-2023-zaterdag","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/hit-city-2023-zaterdag","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/hit-city-2023-zaterdag","en":null},"title":"Hit The City 2023 | Zaterdag","content":"\u003cp\u003eHit The City is terug op 19-21 oktober! Net als voorgaande jaren trekken we de levendigheid van Dutch Design Week door naar de avond met een geheel gratis muziekfestival georganiseerd en geprogrammeerd door Effenaar en Friendly Fire.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003eOntdek drie dagen lang de nieuwste en meest veelbelovende acts, grensverleggende muziek en een diversiteit aan genres op meer dan tien bruisende locaties in Eindhoven.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"Hit The City 2023 | Zaterdag","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1686255191,"machine":"2023-06-08T20:13:11+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Hit The City line-up ","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=8hEs4Q9p","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=AKt_gnCM","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=A-w53xH9","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=vEEsawAO","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=fAbFxhwz","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=sQ4mxy5Y"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=8hEs4Q9p 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=AKt_gnCM 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=A-w53xH9 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=vEEsawAO 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=fAbFxhwz 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-10/HTC%20line-up.png?itok=sQ4mxy5Y 720w"]},"sour