3cp\u003eMuzikaal is het allemaal heel anders dan wat RHEA ooit heeft gedaan, maar het is allemaal organisch tot stand gekomen, vanaf de allereerste riff die Van de Sande op papier zette. Toen begon hij te twijfelen. Zal dit voor ons werken? Moet ik het niet gewoon allemaal weggooien? Maar hoe meer de band zich in het materiaal verdiepte, hoe meer ze zich realiseerden dat dit precies was wat ze wilden doen: nieuwe wegen inslaan.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"7c8524ab-34d7-495a-9977-5ed0f211a2ee","header":{"title":"Van disco naar funk naar ballads"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eHet is nog steeds rockmuziek, maar het omarmt nieuwe invloeden: er zitten stukjes funk in het ene nummer, disco in het andere en zelfs een ballad. Door nieuwe instrumenten toe te voegen zoals viool, piano, Hammond of mellotron, groovy baslicks en wah-wah-pedalen, klinkt RHEA groovyer dan ooit. Eerste single Creeping Through My Head laat zich het beste omschrijven als RHEA meets Kravitz.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"737e6317-7c0e-4338-9553-ab4415aff66e","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/puhVbmZ2WYM?si=Y1fMYk6EomUy7GNT\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"effenaar_quote","id":"d98cb460-50c0-418e-9b75-4265fa78d662","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"quote":"RHEA stond voor het eerst op Rock Werchter en laat het niet de laatste keer zijn.","author":"Dansende Beren"}},{"type":"effenaar_quote","id":"56ab40b1-15cd-43b6-b932-ec85a0ebca99","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"quote":"The best Belpop of the moment.","author":"De Morgen"}},{"type":"effenaar_quote","id":"5e168054-516f-43f5-8974-ba393927680b","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"quote":"The titans of RHEA make dirty rock according to the book.","author":"Studio Brussel"}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"97f80f9f-a3ae-429f-a3d2-d538c23c0c5c","header":{"title":"Support: Killed by Martians"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eEchte Veghelse ‘Basement Rock’ ontstaan in de kelder van de Noordkade. Een band geïnspireerd door de omgeving waarin ze repeteren. Een stevige structuur met een rauw randje, dat is Killed by Martians. Een band waarvan de basis gelegd wordt door een stevige bas en drumpartij dat dient als lanceerplatform voor de gitaar die scheurend de ruimte in gaat!\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003eDit power trio maakt muziek dat doet denken aan een combinatie tussen Queens of the Stone Age, Royal Blood, Wolfmother en een vleugje Nirvana om de mix af te maken.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"killed by martians","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=tdmqcjcB","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=jTN_8Ybu","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=yrfRwIJ_","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=geLn3-RM","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=NwKDNduv","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=uSw2vSL9"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=tdmqcjcB 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=jTN_8Ybu 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=yrfRwIJ_ 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=geLn3-RM 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=NwKDNduv 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-03/WhatsApp%20Image%202024-02-28%20at%2019.46.59.jpeg?itok=uSw2vSL9 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"801c54c7-015c-4cdc-8520-e64ceb2fb2db","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe style=\"border-radius:12px\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/artist/2A4ruaepZ7R9wgT1TpmdJH?utm_source=generator\" width=\"100%\" height=\"352\" frameBorder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724622556,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-rhea-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-rhea-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":739,"slug":"/agenda/hideous","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/hideous","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/hideous","en":null},"title":"Hideous ","content":"","meta":{"title":"Hideous ","description":"Na een spetterende show op Come As You Are keren de Vlaamse rockers van HIDEOUS terug, en dit keer naar Café Wilhelmina. Hideous is het gloednieuwe samengesteld gezin van gitaristen Guillaume Lamont (RHEA) en Tim Leyman (Ramkot). Beiden verdienden ze al hun strepen bij de genoemde projecten, maar ze besloten om hun krachten te bundelen. Hideous brengt rockmuziek geïnspireerd op de ruwheid van de jaren '90. Rechtdoor zonder nadenken, maar toch het belang van een zwevende melodie niet onderschatten.","image":{"image":{"alt":"Hideous","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=4AlO_bk2","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=lwL_W_CZ","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=fz13R1AV","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=H7MgGvPh","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=jp9qVDHh","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=2P_R8doQ"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=4AlO_bk2 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=lwL_W_CZ 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=fz13R1AV 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=H7MgGvPh 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=jp9qVDHh 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-12/Hideous%20%E2%80%