MADMAD / Verstärker / Butch Kassidy / YOBS / Ashinoa.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFriday line-up:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\r\nGilla Band / Night Beats / Frankie and The Witch Fingers / Crows / The Men / The Underground Youth / The Black Delta Movement / The Third Sound / RMFTM / Golden Hours / Flying Moon In Space / Butch Kassidy / YOBS / Ashinoa\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"effenaar_image","id":"c23591e7-83a2-4d7c-ba4e-a7d2a6c403af","header":{"title":"Timetable","description":null},"content":{"image":{"image":{"alt":"Fuzz Club timetable nieuw","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=QXMB7jSx","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=be8kcO6o","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=3p0imzV2","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=a8zT2zKx","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=Vd-F8rdx","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=TdyD4i-r"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=QXMB7jSx 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=be8kcO6o 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=3p0imzV2 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=a8zT2zKx 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=Vd-F8rdx 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-05/Fuzz%20Club%20timetable%201080x1080.png?itok=TdyD4i-r 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"is_fullscreen":false}},{"type":"cta","id":"1ba358b0-7bf2-45aa-9bcf-3e6d640aa039","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"cta_title":"Fuzz Club Eindhoven, 3 + 4 May 2024","cta_description":null,"url":{"uri":"https://www.effenaar.nl/nl/fuzzclubeindhoven2024","title":"Click here for an overview of the entire event","options":{"url":"https://www.effenaar.nl/nl/fuzzclubeindhoven2024"}},"description":null,"title":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"4471fb0a-158e-4bd1-b964-05f071344cbe","header":{"title":"A dive into the line-up"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eHeadlining the festival will be \u003cstrong\u003eSpiritualized\u003c/strong\u003e, helmed by sonic explorer J. Spaceman (Jason Pierce) who has long been a linchpin of contemporary psychedelia since his prior band Spacemen 3 formed and subsequently changed the game in 1982. Over the nine Spiritualized albums that followed that first group’s acrimonious split – from cult classics like their 1992 debut ‘Lazer Guided Melodies’ and 1997’s\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e‘Ladies and gentlemen we are floating in space’ up to, most recently, 2022’s ‘Everything Was Beautiful’ – Pierce’s experiments with psychedelia, gospel, blues and drone, whether hushed atmospherics or orchestral epics, have consistently marked Spiritualized out to be a singular, highly-influential force in this musical world and beyond.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003eAlso joining are Dublin noise-rock heroes \u003cstrong\u003eGilla Band \u003c/strong\u003e(fka Girl Band), whose floor-shaking, ferocious live shows have earned them a notorious reputation and dedicated following over the last decade. Chilean artist \u003cstrong\u003eFöllakzoid\u003c/strong\u003e will be serving up a late-night set blurring the lines between immersive minimal techno – 2023’s ‘V’ LP being their most fully-fledged embrace of the dancefloor yet – and trance-inducing psychedelica.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"image_carousel","id":"f96d0071-4fa6-4fa0-a631-da465794bc74","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"items":[{"image":{"alt":"Gilla Band","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=tDL8_ZIY","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=MKWx_0G6","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=8en5AS48","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=_n7yQqhB","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=DAeTDgne","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=oTu_HUXb"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=tDL8_ZIY 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=MKWx_0G6 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=8en5AS48 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=_n7yQqhB 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=DAeTDgne 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-02/Gilla%20Band.png?itok=oTu_HUXb 720w"]},"source":"Gilla Band","source_link":null},{"image":{"alt":"Spiritualized","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-02/Spiritualized.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=pg_H8j_5","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=RrFqIRCt","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=C96ju6Zh","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=tyxB9FOH","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=r2Xr_1QO","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=EntmwAxI"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=pg_H8j_5 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=RrFqIRCt 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=C96ju6Zh 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=tyxB9FOH 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=r2Xr_1QO 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-02/Spiritualized.png?itok=EntmwAxI 720w"]},"source":"Spiritualized","source_link":null},{"image":{"alt":"Follakzoid","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-02/follakzoid.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=UlSSKQEO","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=dc1cFqsW","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=KnX-QjC1","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=O0SAqstb","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=HEr7P6uM","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=DfXVrk0Y"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=UlSSKQEO 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=dc1cFqsW 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=KnX-QjC1 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=O0SAqstb 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=HEr7P6uM 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-02/follakzoid.png?itok=DfXVrk0Y 720w"]},"source":"Föllakzoid","source_link":null}]}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"6fdfe57b-1384-4d81-9734-bbd96bd1df56","header":{"title":null},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNight Beats\u003c/strong\u003e is an American psychedelic/garage rock project led by Danny Lee Blackwell, who released the sixth studio album Rajan earlier this year. The album musically navigates somewhere between a vintage Western film and a psych-pop opus, infused with Anatolian funk and soulful R\u0026amp;B. Hailing from Los Langeles, \u003cstrong\u003eFrankie And The Witch Fingers\u003c/strong\u003e bring their wild psych-punk freak-outs off the back of their recently released album Data Doom. The prolific Brooklyn four-piece\u003cstrong\u003e The Men\u003c/strong\u003e present a rare European show in support of their ninth and latest album New York City - a collection of timeless, nocturnal rock 'n' roll.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003eWith their infamous sweaty live shows, London's post-punk heavyweights \u003cstrong\u003eCrows\u003c/strong\u003e and the uncompromising, abrasive noise-rock of \u003cstrong\u003eThe Psychotic Monks\u003c/strong\u003e will make the floors of Effenaar shake. Also confirmed are Fuzz Club linchpins and psychedelic post-punks \u003cstrong\u003eThe Underground Youth\u003c/strong\u003e and electronic producer \u003cstrong\u003eAl Lover\u003c/strong\u003e, who will be serving up both a DJ set and a live performance featuring his distinctive mix of psychedelic beats, dub, and krautrock.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"image_carousel","id":"7feb59a6-83e3-4c3c-a654-e38e5ec036a4","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"items":[{"image":{"alt":"Night Beats","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=g-ePk8gy","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=fd8JYQbu","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=Iqwn2c_F","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=nwDRrL9U","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=ywW1DkaG","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=Eunf6ksb"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=g-ePk8gy 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=fd8JYQbu 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=Iqwn2c_F 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=nwDRrL9U 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=ywW1DkaG 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-12/Night%20Beats.jpg?itok=Eunf6ksb 720w"]},"source":"Night Beats","source_link":null},{"image":{"alt":"Frankie and the Witch Fingers","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-12/Frankie%20Witch%20Fingers%20by%20Travis%20Trautt.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/Frankie%20Witch%20Fingers%20by%20Travis%20Trautt.png?itok=2JK_RIJb","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/Frankie%20Witch%20Fingers%20by%20Travis%20Trautt.png?itok=qvB-tlo7","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-1