an.png?itok=BaADXtCk 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"locations":[{"id":116,"title":"Grote zaal","is_external":false}],"state":"sold_out","club_card_event":false,"colors":{"accent_color":"#014034","background_color":"#F2F2F2","text_color":"#000000"}},{"nid":2008,"title":"NOFX: 40 Years of Fuckin' Up","subtitle":"Film + Q\u0026A met El Hefe","slug":"/agenda/40-years-fuckin-up-nofx","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/40-years-fuckin-up-nofx","date":{"timestamp":1793059200,"machine":"2026-10-27"},"thumbnail_image":{"image":{"alt":"NOFX","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=5FyPYHtP","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=smYv_jLW","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=ZAbx_0gY","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=9gBNJ2sy","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=WEA3Z5a2","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=8QbsQS9g"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=5FyPYHtP 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=smYv_jLW 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=ZAbx_0gY 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=9gBNJ2sy 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=WEA3Z5a2 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-09/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20onlyNOFX.png?itok=8QbsQS9g 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"locations":[{"id":116,"title":"Grote zaal","is_external":false}],"state":"sold_out","club_card_event":false,"colors":{"accent_color":"#46bdb6","background_color":"#000000","text_color":"#ffffff"}}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"60650904-5967-4287-88dd-0a3cba081c34","header":{"title":null},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eHun luidruchtige en genadeloos eerlijke nummers gaan over thema’s als overleven in de nacht, jeugdliefde, met goedkope champagne doordrenkte steegfeesten en onstuimige straatprotesten. Maar Upchuck schudt vooral de geesten van mensen die op zoek zijn naar een uitlaatklep; songwriter KT schreeuwt haar verhaal en deelt de trauma’s van huiveringwekkende discriminatie, onwetendheid en leven in een gedoemde generatie. In een wereld met willekeurige regels en flinterdun moralisme, verbinden ze de luisteraar met hun anthems voor iedereen die zich niet gehoord voelt. Met Stroomhuis als het perfecte decor voor hun meedogenloze en in-your-face liveshow, wil je vrijdag 17 mei niet missen!\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"f0900b01-c43b-40ca-a458-d75f1ae546a2","header":{"title":"Tijdschema"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003e19:30 uur: Deuren open\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n20:00 uur: Show The Covids\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n21:10 uur: Show Upchuck\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n(tijden zijn onder voorbehoud)\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"cb7579a8-48c3-462a-a3a4-a4fcce267df5","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oObKmwmZoOM?si=Bttlc67SjStc11og\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"e073d578-a2d3-4288-af0e-01049b1db7d6","header":{"title":"The Covids"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDe Amsterdamse band The Covids zet een vrolijke revolutie in gang. Deze optimistische, jonge versie van The Buzzcocks biedt ontsnapping uit de dagelijkse saaiheid en geeft een authentieke sound nieuwe glans. Hun aanstekelijke, rauwe en energieke geluid laat het klinken alsof je in een punkhol in het Manchester van de late jaren '70 bent beland. Deze avond zie je ze als support van Upchuck!\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"The Covids","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=RjQbjBT8","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=5Y8WFlFg","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=RmpbJkb1","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=GmYLmsLn","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=BLwvet-k","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=zZIHeB5P"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=RjQbjBT8 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=5Y8WFlFg 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=RmpbJkb1 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=GmYLmsLn 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=BLwvet-k 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-02/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-09-15%20at%2013.54.05.jpeg?itok=zZIHeB5P 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"40a9dbc4-ec12-4626-8d21-99bffea3e1b1","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qtkxwePxQ7o?si=Cr8plJb6TGFZrVB_\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724627786,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-upchuck-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-upchuck-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":887,"slug":"/agenda/egyptian-blue","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/egyptian-blue","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/egyptian-blue","en":null},"title":"Egyptian Blue","content":"\u003cp\u003eDat het debuutalbum van het uit Brighton afkomstige postpunkkwartet Egyptian Blue langverwacht is, is een understatement. Na een handjevol indrukwekkende en stevige singles speelden ze zichzelf al eerder in de kijker, en nu zijn ze gelukkig terug met hun eerste album A Living Commodity (2023).\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"Egyptian Blue","description":"","image":null},"