c":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=JihIrLeA","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=xfXP3Epd","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=dDhzVXXq","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=G5MtQtlZ","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=pcoIFteQ","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=BaADXtCk"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=JihIrLeA 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=xfXP3Epd 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=dDhzVXXq 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=G5MtQtlZ 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=pcoIFteQ 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=BaADXtCk 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"locations":[{"id":116,"title":"Grote zaal","is_external":false}],"state":"sold_out","club_card_event":false,"colors":{"accent_color":"#014034","background_color":"#F2F2F2","text_color":"#000000"}}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"648b0010-b78c-47aa-8b03-e2aecdf0686b","header":{"title":null},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eMet grillige riffs die door brute herhaling haast hypnotiserend zijn, de hoekigheid van bands als Gang of Four en een lekker tegendraadse en geestdriftige energie, hebben ze het recept van het typerende postpunk geluid in handen en gemeesterd. Maar het geluid Egyptian Blue is allesbehalve de dertiende in een dozijn. Op A Living Commodity is er zowel ruimte voor benauwende spanningsbogen, wringende drumpartijen en scherpe teksten over een verloren generatie als voor hemelse gitaarlijnen en jazzy breakbeats. Ze kregen alvast de zegen van Foals, waarvan de invloeden overigens duidelijk te horen zijn in het geluid van de band, en IDLES’ Joe Talbot. Dat belooft wat, op zondag 19 mei in het Stroomhuis!\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"12bcfc89-582c-460e-a6f8-8bf51a92ae4f","header":{"title":"Tijdschema"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003e19:30 uur: Deuren open\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n20:00 uur: Show Dim Imagery\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n21:10 uur: Show Egyptian Blue\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n(tijden zijn onder voorbehoud)\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"cb85717a-6578-44fd-9f35-37c81d6191e5","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EoURfu55FCg?si=RFhpW64IK0nQjpwH\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"1d06a43f-09ac-4a97-bc8c-fa29662bda4a","header":{"title":"Dim Imagery"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eCrank wave, Flegel-core, post-Brexit pop. Het vijftal van Dim Imagery uit Leeds weigert zich in een hokje te laten plaatsen op genre, maar valt in plaats daarvan nummers aan met precisie, robotachtige ritmes en verontrustende geluidsmuren. Met de hardere tonen van art-rock, new wave \u0026amp; krautrock, en toch coherent, evenwichtig en beweeglijk.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"Dim Imagery","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=t1YKbL4c","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=gqmUDMvk","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=jFxi-0mr","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=fIWiiZac","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=cFqpq0pp","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=mJCQsxpW"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=t1YKbL4c 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=gqmUDMvk 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=jFxi-0mr 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=fIWiiZac 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=cFqpq0pp 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-05/received_716201713766226.jpeg?itok=mJCQsxpW 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"b1b2fa28-a73d-4f77-b495-98d2c5f0fdd7","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315