400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=xfXP3Epd 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=dDhzVXXq 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=G5MtQtlZ 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=pcoIFteQ 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-11/%20%E2%80%93%20Square%20afbeelding%20only%20dotan.png?itok=BaADXtCk 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"locations":[{"id":116,"title":"Grote zaal","is_external":false}],"state":"sold_out","club_card_event":false,"colors":{"accent_color":"#014034","background_color":"#F2F2F2","text_color":"#000000"}}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"24db001e-edcc-4cb3-bad7-dcefbcae4ffa","header":{"title":"Tijdschema"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003e19:30 uur: Deuren open\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n20:00 uur: Show THAMES\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n21:10 uur: Show Hallan\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n(tijden zijn onder voorbehoud)\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"bab43b2b-0e86-42ab-9dcf-ad5b0d819454","header":{"title":"Hallan"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDe Britse band Hallan zoekt zijn inspiratie in de goede hoek; hun scherpe post-punk doet denken aan de klassieke sound van bands als Joy Division en The Fall. In de dramatische omgeving van een 18e-eeuws fort in de heuvels van Portsmouth, niet de minste repetitielocatie, schrijft\u0026nbsp; frontman Conor Clements observerende poëzie en bemoedigende teksten over onzekerheden, de sleur van het dagelijkse bestaan en innerlijke frustraties. Over rijen in de supermarkt, je Facebook feed of de buren, om een paar voorbeelden te noemen. Op hun laatste EP ‘The Noise Of A Firing Gun’ laten ze de alledaagsheid van de 21e eeuw echter achter zich, en richten ze zich zowel thematisch als muzikaal op het verleden met verhalen over historische individuen en een royale hoeveelheid jaren ’80 synthesizers. Met nog altijd een herkenbaar post-punk randje.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"hallan 1","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-12/hallan%201.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=bPDbZjLM","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=GVep3iqp","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=z7xfxxfG","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=c09WWIwU","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=2mlkztlJ","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=J72krYwM"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=bPDbZjLM 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=GVep3iqp 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=z7xfxxfG 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=c09WWIwU 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=2mlkztlJ 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-12/hallan%201.png?itok=J72krYwM 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"effenaar_quote","id":"c43edd12-c82d-42e8-bf2f-4c258a2b8e6e","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"quote":"Melding post-punk","author":"Clash Magazine"}},{"type":"embed","id":"da6903d0-2c78-462f-a199-1de678970f56","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/f65FVPkBrbs?si=8toaNNl8F2Q3yrw-\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"7dbabaf5-dcc3-41de-85c8-2c8643d7644f","header":{"title":"THAMES"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eTHAMES is de gloednieuwe post-punk band rondom zanger en gitarist Merlyn Baartman. En zoals de naam al doet vermoeden, is de blik gericht op Engeland. In hun moderne geluid hoor je Britse (en Ierse) punk en new wave-invloeden en inspiratiebronnen als The Cure, Fontaines D.C. en IDLES terug. Dansbaar en catchy, maar wel met een kwetsbaar randje; in de nummers gaan ze de strijd aan met toxic masculinity en de traagheid van emancipatie. Dat in combinatie met een goede dosis energie maakt ze een frisse toevoeging aan het Nederlandse post-punk circuit!\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"THAMES ","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-12/thames1.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=j76IQV4V","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=40VSwTH-","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=Qz8uippp","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=jsaznz1K","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=PVgeWuuk","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=7-CbO6TE"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=j76IQV4V 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=40VSwTH- 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=Qz8uippp 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=jsaznz1K 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=PVgeWuuk 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-12/thames1.png?itok=7-CbO6TE 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"de7a78f9-3134-4f72-a0fc-9aafefa8aa0b","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S6Wv_cjnc2Y?si=f9y-ntC47tSAJ3vz\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724629259,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-hallan-thames-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-hallan-thames-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":796,"slug":"/agenda/robert-cray-band","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/robert-cray-band","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/robert-cray-band","en":null},"title":"The Robert Cray Band","content":"\u003cp\u003eSommige gitaristen zijn werkelijk ‘the full package’. Robert Cray is zo iemand: begenadigd (blues)rockgitarist, een warme, krachtige zangstem en erg fijne songschrijverscapaciteiten. Het legde de man geen windeieren: vijf Grammy’s, een paar dikke hits (zoals Right Next Door) en mooie samenwerkingen met grootheden als Eric Clapton, Stevie Ray Vaughan, Bonnie Raitt en John Lee Hooker.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"The Robert Cray Band tijdens BRIDGE Guitar Festival 2024","description":"Sommige gitaristen zijn werkelijk ‘the full package’. Robert Cray is zo iemand: begenadigd (blues)rockgitarist, een warme, krachtige zangstem en erg fijne songschrijverscapaciteiten. Het legde de man geen windeieren: vijf Grammy’s, een paar dikke hits (zoals Right Next Door) en mooie samenwerkingen met grootheden als Eric Clapton, Stevie Ray Vaughan, Bonnie Raitt en John Lee Hooker.\r\n\r\nRobert Cray verzorgt met zijn band de openingsshow tijdens Bridge 2024 in de Effenaar. Een aftrap die ongetwijfeld goed besteed is aan deze stermuzikant. ","image":{"image":{"alt":"The Robert Cray Band header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-12/THE%20ROBERT%20CRAY%20BAND%20-%201920x1080%20web%20header.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/THE%20ROBERT%20CRAY%20BAND%20-%201920x1080%20web%20header.jpg?itok=q_wGpxUh","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/THE%20ROBERT%20CRAY%20BAND%20-%201920x1080%20web%20header.jpg?itok=QW0W-V4v","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-12/THE%20ROBERT%20CRAY%20BAND%20-%201920x1080%20web%20header.jpg?itok=Ymu84hdd","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-12/THE%20ROBERT%20CRAY%20BAND%20-%201920x1080%20web%20header.jpg?itok=il1xvp97","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-12/THE%20ROBERT%20CRAY%20BAND%20-%201920x1080%20web%20header.jpg?itok=rL5XXBUD","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-12/THE%20ROBERT%20CRAY%20BAND%20-%201920x1080%20web%20header.jpg?itok=s1jbRxP6"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-12/THE%20ROBERT%20CRAY%20BAND%20-%201920x1080%20web%20header.jpg?itok=q_wGpxUh 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-12/THE%20ROBERT%20CRAY%20BAND%20-%201920x1080%20web%20header.jpg?itok=QW0W-V4v 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-12/THE%20ROBERT%20CRAY%20BAND%20-%201920x1080%20web%20header.jpg?itok=Ymu84hdd 2510w","https://d12