l":{"uri":"https://shop.tickets.cm.com/81dc8e4c-0d08-0aa6-e54b-a336488fe2a0","title":"","options":{"url":"https://shop.tickets.cm.com/81dc8e4c-0d08-0aa6-e54b-a336488fe2a0"}},"ticket_price":"26.00","state":null,"locker_reservation":false,"restaurant_reservation":true,"related_events":[]}]}},{"type":"related_longr_story","id":"1de9b604-8cc0-47e6-80d8-930a65d56ad5","header":{"title":"Meer lezen: ","description":null},"content":{"items":[{"type":"longread","nid":1950,"slug":"/artikelen/vrijstaat-geeft-eindhoven-zijn-rafelrandjes-terug","endpoint":"/nl/artikelen/vrijstaat-geeft-eindhoven-zijn-rafelrandjes-terug","translations":{"nl":"/artikelen/vrijstaat-geeft-eindhoven-zijn-rafelrandjes-terug","en":null},"title":"Vrijstaat geeft Eindhoven zijn rafelrandjes terug ","content":"\u003cp\u003eIn het midden van de Vrijstraat, tussen de stenen panden en met het geroezemoes van de binnenstad verdrukt op de achtergrond, kan je sinds kort met je voeten in het zand de tijd voorbij laten glijden. Vrijstaat is dé nieuwe locatie in het hart van Eindhoven. Waar niets moet, en bijna alles kan. \u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Vrijstaat geeft Eindhoven zijn rafelrandjes terug ","description":"Ontdek de nieuwe achtertuin van de stad.","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1782214611,"machine":"2026-06-23T11:36:51+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Vrijstaat","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=BFEEC39u","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=VIalvXG0","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=AxIV9oEs","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=YxHFVWuO","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=tGHSy1K6","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=VEVzIxSv"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=BFEEC39u 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=VIalvXG0 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=AxIV9oEs 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=YxHFVWuO 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=tGHSy1K6 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-06/20260529_Vrijstaat_MaxKneefel_FMK4397_1.png?itok=VEVzIxSv 720w"]},"source":"Foto: Max Kneefel | v.l.n.r. Bart Retera en Jeannot Keser","source_link":null},"breadcrumb":null,"subtitle":"Door Roeline Machiels","thumbnail_image":{"image":{"alt":"Vrijstaat","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=xmgHsctR","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=uHPS-TCQ","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=U6Dcb-If","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=3fFstowN","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=-kz1O2Ch","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=V4dPsbef"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=xmgHsctR 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=uHPS-TCQ 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=U6Dcb-If 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=3fFstowN 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=-kz1O2Ch 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-06/thumbweb_0.png?itok=V4dPsbef 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"colors":{"accent_color":"#DA8500","background_color":"#DDD0C4","text_color":"#000000"},"tags":[],"related_events":[]},{"type":"longread","nid":1954,"slug":"/artikelen/van-vreemden-naar-vrienden-music-strangers-brengt-de-wereld-samen-eindhoven","endpoint":"/nl/artikelen/van-vreemden-naar-vrienden-music-strangers-brengt-de-wereld-samen-eindhoven","translations":{"nl":"/artikelen/van-vreemden-naar-vrienden-music-strangers-brengt-de-wereld-samen-eindhoven","en":null},"title":"Van vreemden naar vrienden: Music with Strangers brengt de wereld samen in Eindhoven","content":"\u003cp\u003eIn een wereld vol botsing en frictie, is het soms lastig om verbinding te vinden, zeker in een groeiende stad die maar liefst 170 nationaliteiten huist. Maar dat is precies wat op een donderdagavond in community space NUL ZES op het voormalige NRE-terrein gebeurt. Overdag een shared workspace, maar op deze avonden is dit het thuishonk voor Music with Strangers, een internationaal gezelschap muziekliefhebbers wat wekelijks samenkomt om te jammen, repeteren en gewoon samen te zijn. \u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Van vreemden naar vrienden: Music with Strangers brengt de wereld samen in Eindhoven","description":"Van een jamsessie met Bruce Springsteen tot een gekozen familie.","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1782662508,"machine":"2026-06-28T16:01:48+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Music with Strangers","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-06/_DSF2492.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=9OZ4KgZP","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=JHvZuPRk","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=bGnh4J7w","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=r9zqYePJ","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=9bOu_iei","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=lWW1W1RO"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=9OZ4KgZP 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=JHvZuPRk 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=bGnh4J7w 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=r9zqYePJ 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=9bOu_iei 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-06/_DSF2492.png?itok=lWW1W1RO 720w"]},"source":"Foto: Miranda Gashi","source_link":null},"breadcrumb":null,"subtitle":"Door Guido Segers","thumbnail_image":{"image":{"alt":"Music with Strangers","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=K_eVdCdY","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=nHXwTEL-","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=WzKJGULd","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=w5PN9322","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=-wRJz_ec","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=5gwiNnIJ"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=K_eVdCdY 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=nHXwTEL- 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=WzKJGULd 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=w5PN9322 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=-wRJz_ec 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-06/strangersthumbb.png?itok=5gwiNnIJ 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"colors":{"accent_color":"#733119","background_color":"#DDD8CC","text_color":"#000000"},"tags":[],"related_events":[]},{"type":"longread","nid":1553,"slug":"/artikelen/zonder-stroomhuis-geen-tramhaus","endpoint":"/nl/artikelen/zonder-stroomhuis-geen-tramhaus","translations":{"nl":"/artikelen/zonder-stroomhuis-geen-tramhaus","en":null},"title":" ‘Zonder Stroomhuis geen Tramhaus’","content":"\u003cp\u003eEffenaar staat op de vrijdag van Hit The City in het teken van het Stroomhuis. Het kenmerkende kraakpand heeft in hooguit twee decennia een onuitwisbare indruk achtergelaten in de underground scene van Eindhoven, en daarbuiten. Niet alleen door vuige optredens en donkere danceavonden, maar vooral ook als vrijplaats voor kunstenaars en muzikanten. Het gebouw is helaas door een brand verwoest, maar de wil om de do it yourself-cultuur in Eindhoven te laten floreren, is bij de oud-bewoners gebleven.\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":" ‘Zonder Stroomhuis geen Tramhaus’","description":"Lees hier het interview met Stroomhuis-crew en Tramhaus.","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1754996858,"machine":"2025-08-12T11:07:38+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Stroomhuis","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=LtxCesWG","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=cZqik96m","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=ZBo1yIcT","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=4jwy1B9z","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=_i2QA-Nq","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=tVLDjRqu"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=LtxCesWG 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=cZqik96m 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=ZBo1yIcT 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=4jwy1B9z 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=_i2QA-Nq 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-08/20240106-Charlie-and-The-Lesbians-138-MarcoSmeets.NL_.png?itok=tVLDjRqu 720w"]},"source":"Foto: Marco Smeets | publiek in Stroomhuis","source_link":null},"breadcrumb":null,"subtitle":"Door Tijs Heesterbeek","thumbnail_image":{"image":{"alt":"Stroomhuis","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-08/thumb.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=mB2KTMss","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=zB6fAHKJ","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=cSib8t0V","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=TpQnRIGx","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=n6eP8cId","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=HM6ZAioj"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=mB2KTMss 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=zB6fAHKJ 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=cSib8t0V 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=TpQnRIGx 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=n6eP8cId 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-08/thumb.png?itok=HM6ZAioj 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"colors":{"accent_color":"#FF8937","background_color":"#000000","text_color":"#FFFFFF"},"tags":[],"related_events":[]},{"type":"longread","nid":264,"slug":"/artikelen/het-stroomhuis-niet-alles-hoeft-zo-gelikt-te-zijn","endpoint":"/nl/artikelen/het-stroomhuis-niet-alles-hoeft-zo-gelikt-te-zijn","translations":{"nl":"/artikelen/het-stroomhuis-niet-alles-hoeft-zo-gelikt-te-zijn","en":null},"title":"Het Stroomhuis: \"Niet alles hoeft zo gelikt te zijn\"","content":"\u003cp\u003eWe hadden \u003ca href=\"https://www.effenaar.nl/artikelen/van-punkhol-naar-professionele-popzaal-50-jaar-effenaar\"\u003ehet er al even over;\u003c/a\u003e van de jaren ’70 en ’80 krakers mentaliteit is er anno nu nog maar weinig over hier in Eindhoven. Krakkemikkige panden worden massaal verruild voor nieuwbouwcomplexen, die als paddestoelen uit de grond groeien en de naam designstad eer aan doen. Indrukwekkend en broodnodig, maar het is ook allemaal zo perfect. Toch is er één plek waar het net even wat anders gaat. Waar er niet zo binnen de lijntjes wordt gekleurd. Ik sprak documentairemaker Abeltje Vrijdag en hét Stroomhuis-duo Koen en Martijn over het Stroomhuis. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"Stroomhuis Eindhoven","description":"Er is een plek in Eindhoven waar het net even wat anders gaat. Waar er niet zo binnen de lijntjes wordt gekleurd. Effenaar sprak documentairemaker Abeltje Vrijdag en hét Stroomhuis-duo Koen en Martijn over het Stroomhuis. ","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1666952789,"machine":"2022-10-28T10:26:29+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Stroomhuis header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2022-10/stroomhuis%20header.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2022-10/stroomhuis%20header.jpg?itok=kBYiysXe","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2022-10/stroomhuis%20header.jpg?itok=OxRm24J5","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2022-10/stroomhuis%20header.jpg?itok=8Wq8kKx7","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2022-10/stroomhuis%20header.jpg?itok=JsawvF7E","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2022-10/stroomhuis%20header.jpg?itok=JsDIz8NY","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2022-10/stroomhuis%20header.jpg?itok=XEJ5kYDD"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2022-10/stroomhuis%20header.jpg?itok=kBYiysXe 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2022-10/stroomhuis%20header.jpg?itok=OxRm24J5 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2022-10/stroomhuis%20header.jpg?itok=8Wq8kKx7 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt