b","header":{"title":"Friday line-up"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eLos Bitchos / Sonic Boom / Orions Belte / Les Big Byrd / Electric Eye / Pretty Lightning / Skloss / Black Doldrums / Error / Smote / Splitterzelle\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"cf90b10d-baab-4c1f-a4be-f47c8ff5ee8f","header":{"title":"The full line-up"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eGoat / Los Bitchos / Sonic Boom / Orions Belte / Rose City Band / The KVB / MIEN / New Candys / Les Big Byrd / RMFTM / Black Market Karma / Maquina. / Errorr / Smote / Acid Rooster / Black Doldrums / Kombynat Robotron / Upupayãma / Electric Eye / Pretty Lightning / Floral Image / Skloss / Saccades / Splitterzelle\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"effenaar_image","id":"8e8d957e-1db1-47bd-9930-2ece939761f6","header":{"title":"Timetable ","description":null},"content":{"image":{"image":{"alt":"Fuzz Club timetable nieuw","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=4GlwNIcE","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=hRxbccmO","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=8ggBEuiP","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=XMlH6B6p","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=lHtLoo2p","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=a_9TQ7se"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=4GlwNIcE 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=hRxbccmO 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=8ggBEuiP 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=XMlH6B6p 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=lHtLoo2p 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-05/UTF-8FC2025_Stage_Times_Spread%20%283%29.png?itok=a_9TQ7se 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"is_fullscreen":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"5cd0e0ed-63dc-475f-a801-9b30fac35e49","header":{"title":"Goat"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eNot much is known about this mysterious masked band, though an apocryphal backstory claims they are just one of many incarnations over the last 30 years of a group from a small, voodoo-worshiping northern town called Korpilombolo. With an unfettered sound influenced by everything from Afrobeat and heavy metal to Anatolian funk and biker rock, Goat is a highly acclaimed psychedelic rock band known for their free-flowing, maximalist approach. Their music can be lushly acoustic, blown-out and danceable, meditative, or infused with hip-hop influences.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"Goat square","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=-s-GS4uK","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=2QPtOMpp","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=K6ZKowDh","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=brOL3-JF","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=gjhnBHyU","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=9R1K7cy1"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=-s-GS4uK 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=2QPtOMpp 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=K6ZKowDh 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=brOL3-JF 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=gjhnBHyU 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/Goat%20squre.png?itok=9R1K7cy1 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"d7bb6f65-69cf-4c62-bde1-7fa748b98d83","header":{"title":"Los Bitchos"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eLos Bitchos are a London-based instrumental band that fuse surf rock, cumbia, and psychedelia into a danceable, feel-good sound, driven by twangy guitars and pulsing rhythms. If their electrifying 2022 debut \u003cem\u003eLet the Festivities Begin!\u003c/em\u003e was the rowdy build-up to a big night out, then their latest album \u003cem\u003eTalkie Talkie\u003c/em\u003e is the Technicolor explosion on the dance floor.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"Los Bitchos 1080x1080","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=PN-TVVmQ","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=SBaMsLmH","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=5ZzoIjh0","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=fIyXix1w","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=jy_kbDCL","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=j3mDGa4u"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=PN-TVVmQ 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=SBaMsLmH 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=5ZzoIjh0 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=fIyXix1w 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=jy_kbDCL 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%201080x1080.jpg?itok=j3mDGa4u 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"adf8f18f-e323-4582-93c6-3466048b6a1e","header":{"title":"Sonic Boom"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003ePeter Kember’s music career began with the formation of Spacemen 3 in 1982, alongside Jason Pierce (Spiritualized). As the influential psych-soul band dissolved, Kember then debuted Sonic Boom with 1990’s Spectrum. His solo project, Sonic Boom, blends poppy psychedelia, lo-fi textures, and unique vocals, crafting a sound that offers euphoric escapism.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"sonic boom 1080x1080","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=9Tk1wNh2","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=fjHupCpt","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=k4u3GU6G","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=HJCcggpW","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=eYUFxq2S","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=Zzn-EZbF"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=9Tk1wNh2 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=fjHupCpt 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=k4u3GU6G 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=HJCcggpW 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=eYUFxq2S 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-02/sonic%20boom%201080x1080.jpg?itok=Zzn-EZbF 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"f096eade-f28b-446d-98da-5b9105402d92","header":{"title":"Rose City Band"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eRose City Band is the wide-screen cosmic country outlet of Ripley Johnson (Moon Duo/Wooden Shjips). Their sound features sun-kissed, timeless country rock rooted in a love for private press records from the mid to late '70s. The band’s newest album, \u003cem\u003eSol Y Sombra\u003c/em\u003e, digs its heels into insatiable grooves, with a parade of catchy songs that conjure a sunset drive through an open desert—both a celebration of a sojourn and a longing for the warmth of home.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"Rose City Band square","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=cyAa9lj3","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=sP3oqNeF","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=auk5wd2M","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=e7NCDVhQ","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=Pa7Tlp_j","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=x32_RTMx"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=cyAa9lj3 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=sP3oqNeF 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=auk5wd2M 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=e7NCDVhQ 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=Pa7Tlp_j 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/Rose%20City%20Band%20square.png?itok=x32_RTMx 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"2fce974a-cd38-441c-add9-08d21188c8d7","header":{"title":"The KVB"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eThe KVB blend reverb-drenched shoegaze with sleek electronic beats, evolving from the gritty energy of their debut \u003cem\u003eAlways Then\u003c/em\u003e—a nod to Cabaret Voltaire and The Jesus and Mary Chain—to the sharp, streamlined sound of more recent albums \u003cem\u003eOnly Now Forever\u003c/em\u003e and \u003cem\u003eUnity\u003c/em\u003e. Their music is a masterclass in atmosphere, fusing nostalgic influences with cutting-edge minimalism.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"THE KVB 1080x1080","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=o4n8QhBj","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=M-ZgR9QK","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=IdXJyctL","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=M-s3L5eD","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=vOk1ecb1","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=FQafF4DO"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=o4n8QhBj 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=M-ZgR9QK 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=IdXJyctL 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=M-s3L5eD 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=vOk1ecb1 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-02/The%20KVB%201080x1080.jpg?itok=FQafF4DO 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"ac9901c2-943e-49d1-917d-70411fc12465","header":{"title":"MIEN"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eMIEN is a dynamic transatlantic collaboration featuring luminaries who have each forged a reputation for their head-spinning sonic creativity. Their approach to psych music combines the essence of its origins with an adventurous mindset, allowing them to create sounds that go beyond cliché genre trappings and studied thrift store cool. Their self-titled album explores a range of atmospheres and journeys, channeling the rich songwriting of 1960s psychedelia into a transcendent experience that reaches far beyond the 21st century.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"MIEN square","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=QSPJw106","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=lFPtvKVo","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=i_Qw7gtt","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=MMgat9YE","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=f4SfeC0-","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=4x6wiq1V"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=QSPJw106 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=lFPtvKVo 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=i_Qw7gtt 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=MMgat9YE 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=f4SfeC0- 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/MIEN%20square.png?itok=4x6wiq1V 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"094e9140-3579-4a02-8543-2e16b44ebb53","header":{"title":"New Candys"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eConcocted from the darkest deviant rock ‘n’ roll ethos and distinctive melodic distortions, New Candys have established themselves as one of the most compelling bands to emerge from Italy in recent years. They are recognized for their unfiltered artistic approach and versatility, seamlessly blending aggressive, gritty sounds with dreamy, introspective tones.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"New Candys square","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=12qEfYsU","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=uW8_nWJb","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=KrCIrMEB","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=ZW1B_ltd","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=U_Qz2XCN","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=X0XtihiB"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=12qEfYsU 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=uW8_nWJb 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=KrCIrMEB 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=ZW1B_ltd 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=U_Qz2XCN 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/New%20Candys%20square.png?itok=X0XtihiB 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"efd97547-4160-4740-a42e-cf5137d6708a","header":{"title":"A dive into the line-up"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDrawing from minimal krautrock repetition, pounding industrial techno and EBM, \u003cstrong\u003eMAQUINA. \u003c/strong\u003ecreates an adrenaline-fuelled sound perfect for dark, sweaty dance floors. \u003cstrong\u003eBlack Market Karma \u003c/strong\u003ebrings psychedelic rock rooted in the sounds of 60s guitar and pop music.\u003cstrong\u003e Les Big Byrd\u003c/strong\u003e is a Swedish psychedelic indie band formed in Stockholm by Joakim Åhlund (The Caesars, Teddybears) and Frans Johansson (Fireside). After the split of their bands, they united over a shared love for experimental rock, blending cosmic rock, shoegaze, and krautrock into a hypnotic, genre-defying sound.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003eThe lineup also features the noise-pop outfit \u003cstrong\u003eERRORR\u003c/strong\u003e, the psychedelic folk and krautrock sounds of \u003cstrong\u003eSmote\u003c/strong\u003e, the psych/noise-rock band’s \u003cstrong\u003eKombynat Robotron \u003c/strong\u003eand\u003cstrong\u003e RMFTM\u003c/strong\u003e, the warm, bluesy psychedelia of \u003cstrong\u003ePretty Lightning\u003c/strong\u003e, and the ferocious psych-rock energy of \u003cstrong\u003eFloral Image\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"image_carousel","id":"30083b36-2532-4d84-af72-7f36fd6bc14b","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"items":[{"image":{"alt":"Les Big Byrd","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-02/Les-Big-Byrd-2-scaled.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/Les-Big-Byrd-2-scaled.jpg?itok=Ifgk3bZV","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/Les-Big-Byrd-2-scaled.jpg?itok=c6l3u4iH","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-02/Les-Big-Byrd-2-scaled.jpg?itok=Xn8YQLmH","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-02/Les-Big-Byrd-2-scaled.jpg?itok=zSc25TGS","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-02/Les-Big-Byrd-2-scaled.jpg?itok=khfquwXw","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-02/Les-Big-Byrd-2-scaled.jpg?itok=RwzySN8B"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.clou