dfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/Kobynat.png?itok=NEfLH7Sh 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/Kobynat.png?itok=J-VWfaPz 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/Kobynat.png?itok=b5MptZvf 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/Kobynat.png?itok=Y1rro23c 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/Kobynat.png?itok=XjOI_nNA 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/Kobynat.png?itok=jz55DkQk 720w"]},"source":"Kombynat Robotron","source_link":null},{"image":{"alt":"Pretty Lightning","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=FXjB6rHd","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=YIGBayc0","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=Vm6B1Xom","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=YciiubE9","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=AX_CMiiO","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=8823UD2m"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=FXjB6rHd 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=YIGBayc0 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=Vm6B1Xom 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=YciiubE9 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=AX_CMiiO 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-10/pretty%20lightningh.png?itok=8823UD2m 720w"]},"source":"Pretty Lightning","source_link":null}]}},{"type":"embed","id":"0b6a3542-368a-4cff-950e-33354a022bbd","header":{"title":"A playlist","description":"\u003cp\u003eGet to know all bands and stream the official playlist\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe style=\"border-radius:12px\" src=\"https://open.spotify.com/embed/playlist/4V8ANQfUHWVV70z7JNLSvF?utm_source=generator\" width=\"100%\" height=\"352\" frameBorder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" loading=\"lazy\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"a7aaf573-3969-4a49-8012-ce83c5628b91","header":{"title":"About Fuzz Club"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eFuzz Club is a London-based independent record label established in 2012 that has since become a crucial catalyst in the international psych community. Under Fuzz Club and its recently-launched Bad Vibrations and Rubber Duck imprints, they are home to the likes of The Jesus and Mary Chain, Night Beats, Tess Parks, Crows, The Men, ORB, The Telescopes, Elephant Stone, Beans, The Vacant Lots, C.O.F.F.I.N and The Underground Youth, to name a few. They have also previously released music by the likes of The Black Angels, A Place To Bury Strangers, Holy Wave, Dead Skeletons, Alan Vega, Anton Newcombe, Sonic Boom and many more. Over the last few years, their cult following has expanded thanks to an ongoing series of deluxe, highly sought-after King Gizzard \u0026amp; The Lizard Wizard official live bootlegs. After hosting various events and festivals in London in their earlier years, in 2018 they launched the first Fuzz Club Festival held at the Effenaar in Eindhoven. A now-annual two-day celebration of fuzz, reverb and drone, previous editions have brought together music lovers travelling to attend from nearly 40 different countries.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"Sam Wiehl","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=kMI5gCFe","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=IciTeh45","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=8V9cMgFM","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=DCuxwiUf","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=9115UihW","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=Zm05ewUl"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=kMI5gCFe 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=IciTeh45 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=8V9cMgFM 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=DCuxwiUf 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=9115UihW 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2024-04/Fuzz%20Club%202019.png?itok=Zm05ewUl 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"related_event","id":"c446ea7e-8b73-41bd-a5d4-028fad68d69b","header":{"title":"Join us on Friday, May 9 and Saturday, May 10","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.facebook.com/events/517910781138647\"\u003eClick here for the Facebook event of Fuzz Club Festival 2025\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"},"content":{"items":[{"type":"event","nid":1212,"slug":"/agenda/fuzz-club-festival-2025-0","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/fuzz-club-festival-2025-0","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/fuzz-club-festival-2025-0","en":null},"title":"Fuzz Club Festival 2025","content":"\u003cp\u003eEindhoven will once again dive into two days of the best of psych, dystopian visuals and vinyl. For those who love everything fuzz, reverb, and drone, we’re excited to announce a collaboration with London-based indie label Fuzz Club for a new edition of Fuzz Club festival. Join us on Friday, May 9, and Saturday, May 10, with performances by Goat, Los Bitchos, Sonic Boom, Orions Belte, Rose City Band, The KVB, MIEN and many more. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"Fuzz Club Festival 2025","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1729691700,"machine":"2024-10-23T13:55:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Los Bitchos header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg?itok=ldpgXPVr","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg?itok=ZsfC_rt5","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg?itok=Jlqe-Irq","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg?itok=IBEnW_PD","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg?itok=OKwJ3Jv6","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg?itok=zDYn-OzK"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg?itok=ldpgXPVr 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg?itok=ZsfC_rt5 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg?itok=Jlqe-Irq 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-02/los%20bitchos%20header.jpg?itok=IBEnW_PD 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles