folk van Brabantse singer-songwriter | + Chloe Foy","upper_title":null,"tickets":[],"tags":[],"date":{"timestamp":1746057600,"machine":"2025-05-01"},"presale":null,"times":{"starts_at":"20:30","ends_at":null,"opens_at":"20:00"},"locations":[],"facebook_event":null,"genres":[],"club_card_event":true,"ticket_url":null,"ticket_price":null,"state":null,"locker_reservation":false,"restaurant_reservation":false,"related_events":[]},{"type":"event","nid":1259,"slug":"/agenda/noah-gundersen-david-ramirez","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/noah-gundersen-david-ramirez","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/noah-gundersen-david-ramirez","en":null},"title":"Noah Gundersen \u0026 David Ramirez","content":"\u003cp\u003eDe Amerikaanse singer-songwriter Noah Gundersen experimenteert al bijna twee decennia met indiefolk en akoestische rock. Zijn gedurfde, genre-overstijgende muziek werd al gebruikt in populaire series als \u003cem\u003eSons of Anarchy\u003c/em\u003e en \u003cem\u003eThe Vampire Diaries\u003c/em\u003e. Op de plaat \u003cem\u003eA Pillar of Salt\u003c/em\u003e (2021) werkte hij samen met Phoebe Bridgers. Ondanks dat hij nog geen 30 is, straalt Noah een opmerkelijk zelfbewustzijn uit. Hij is geen \"oude ziel,\" maar iemand die van jongs af aan gewend was zijn geloof en de wereld om hem heen kritisch te bevragen.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"Noah Gundersen \u0026 David Ramirez","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1733219700,"machine":"2024-12-03T09:55:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Noah Gundersen \u0026 David Ramirez header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-12/NG%20%26%20DR%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2024-12/NG%20%26%20DR%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=nTwXADvo","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2024-12/NG%20%26%20DR%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg?itok=rmylo5Qg","2510w