erigheid, maar aangevuld met glimmende synths, meer groove en een duidelijke knipoog naar late ’90s dance, waardoor de plaat af en toe bijna clubachtig aanvoelt. Psychedelica om op te dansen dus, of in ieder geval om je even helemaal in te verliezen.\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"7673b530-7d32-4182-af41-a9df588b316a","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hFYKPE68PgE?si=TmTShT-E0SgIpH0e\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":2,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724749961,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-temples-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-temples-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":975,"slug":"/agenda/vaudou-game","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/vaudou-game","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/vaudou-game","en":null},"title":"Vaudou Game","content":"\u003cp\u003eVaudou Game is de Frans-Togolese muzikale creatie van zanger en gitarist Peter Solo. Zelf komt hij uit Aného-Glidji (Togo), de geboorteplaats van de Guin-stam en diepgeworteld in de voodoo cultuur waarin de verbinding met de aarde en alles wat daarop groeit en bloeit centraal staat.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"Vaudou Game","description":"","image":null},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1713344100,"machine":"2024-04-17T08:55:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Vaudou Game header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2024-04/%20%E2%80%93%201920x1080%20Website.jpg","si