u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003eDJ CONTEST WINNER\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003eHosted by MC ACTIVATE\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724683446,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-portal-next-gen-1-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-portal-next-gen-1-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":1691,"slug":"/agenda/carnaval-effenar-heavy-hossen-0","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/carnaval-effenar-heavy-hossen-0","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/carnaval-effenar-heavy-hossen-0","en":null},"title":"Carnaval in EffeNAR: Heavy Hossen","content":"\u003cp\u003eWie zegt dat rock- en metalheads niet van carnaval houden? Heb jij ooit gezien hoe die bands er de godganse dag bij lopen? Twister Sister? Ghost? Slipknot? Rob Zombie? Sleep Token? Kiss? Immortal? Gwar? Bij ons is het verdomme ALTIJD carnaval. Ben jij ooit op Grindhoven geweest? Dat is toch ook gewoon carnaval? Precies. Daarom organiseren wij vandaag speciaal voor alle rock- en metalheads in Lampegat \u003cstrong\u003eHeavy Hossen\u003c/strong\u003e in d’n EffeNAR. Met de meest carnavaleske rock en metalsongs, van thrash tot hardrock, van Motörhead tot Judas Priest tot Mötley Crüe tot Limp Bizkit tot Toy Dolls. Maar ook met de échte carnavalskrakers. Want noem ons een nummer waarop het beter circlepitten is dan ‘Laat Maar Waaien’? Of een rocktrack waar je een betere sit-down kan doen dan op ‘Zak Es Lekker Door’? Of beter headbangen dan op 'Confetti In M'n Bier'? Precies, bestaat niet.\u003c/p\u003e","meta":{"title":"Carnaval in EffeNAR: Heavy Hossen | Effenaar","description":"Tijdens Heavy Hossen in EffeNAR kende genieten van Carnavals hits én metal, punk en rock krakers! Met DJ teams van Effenaar, The Jack, Altstadt en Dynamo ben je aan het juist adres om te Heavy Hossen!","image":{"image":{"alt":"Heavy hossen","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=f37NJDkK","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=Aq6haFcm","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=X9LYIWXU","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=6tBOwRJ1","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=9fq0fkH-","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=CGB-h8By"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=f37NJDkK 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=Aq6haFcm 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=X9LYIWXU 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=6tBOwRJ1 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=9fq0fkH- 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=CGB-h8By 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null}},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1762957100,"machine":"2025-11-12T14:18:20+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Heavy hossen","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%20Hosssen%202026.png?itok=f37NJDkK","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2025-11/Heavy%2