pe":"paragraph","id":"53bdf84b-ac81-4cfe-a8bb-5724d93e5a2e","header":{"title":"Tijdschema"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003e19:30 Deuren open\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n20:00-20:50 Sum Of R\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n21:20 Wyatt E\u003cbr /\u003e\r\n(tijden onder voorbehoud)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"effenaar_quote","id":"5afd3fd6-0c74-472b-be3a-836c668381b1","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"quote":"The ensemble is elegant, shimmering and emotionally elevated, combining sacred elements to sorrowful bleak industrialism. Imagine if the monolithic epic doom-rock pieces of Earth or Godspeed You! Black Emperor resonate into a pagan-ritual ambient sounding procession in touch with the divine nature and you’ll have a first idea. Massive, enthralling and mystical.","author":"Igloo Magazine, USA"}},{"type":"embed","id":"6304b650-f234-459e-b716-948c4542653f","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N25oBUfHwjg\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"a2587966-9bd9-4f68-8f7d-50a7969cdbdf","header":{"title":"Wyatt E"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eWyatt E. zijn gehuld in mysterie en laten hun muziek heel erg spreken. En als het praat, zorgt het voor diepe meditatie en buitenaardse vibes in overvloed. Gelaagde instrumentatie en sfeer om een ​​hypnotiserende soundscape te creëren die eb en vloed is en luisteraars meeneemt op een reis ver voorbij het fysieke rijk.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"55cb5e06-ef75-4388-90ea-2f5d895b631f","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XoZ-JcIr_d8\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}},{"type":"featured_paragraph","id":"5a144c0f-239b-4a05-9fa8-23e85647ff14","header":{"title":"Bridge - Eindhoven Guitar Festival"},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eDeze show is onderdeel van het BRIDGE festival.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","image":{"image":{"alt":"Bridge Gitaarfestival Eindhoven","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=lHiuCEx0","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=ByRLFbJL","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=h2d3RlXX","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=v1yskyqK","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=LOow0-xK","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=m2QTOBO8"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=lHiuCEx0 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=ByRLFbJL 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=h2d3RlXX 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=v1yskyqK 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=LOow0-xK 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=m2QTOBO8 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"image_align":"left","links":null}},{"type":"cta","id":"75b8fec4-d6fa-48f0-89c8-f87de7d30937","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"cta_title":null,"cta_description":null,"url":{"uri":"https://www.effenaar.nl/agenda/bridge-do-11-mei","title":"Lees hier meer over dit gratis gitaarfestival","options":{"url":"https://www.effenaar.nl/agenda/bridge-do-11-mei"}},"description":null,"title":null}},{"type":"cta","id":"8a693612-67aa-4f63-a9db-da987dbf5bd5","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"cta_title":null,"cta_description":{"value":"\u003cp\u003eAlvast een locker reserveren?\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","format":"basic_html","processed":"\u003cp\u003eAlvast een locker reserveren?\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"url":{"uri":"https://effenaar.elockers.online/register","title":"Dat doe je via deze link!","options":{"url":"https://effenaar.elockers.online/register"}},"description":null,"title":null}},{"type":"cta","id":"d31a61e8-9bb5-4e5c-be33-3ec2e94111c2","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"cta_title":null,"cta_description":{"value":"\u003cp\u003eVooraf een hapje eten in ons restaurant? Je bent van harte welkom.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","format":"basic_html","processed":"\u003cp\u003eVooraf een hapje eten in ons restaurant? Je bent van harte welkom.\u003c/p\u003e\n"},"url":{"uri":"https://www.effenaar.nl/restaurant/menu","title":"Bekijk hier onze menukaart en reserveer je tafel","options":{"url":"https://www.effenaar.nl/restaurant/menu"}},"description":null,"title":null}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":2,"dataUpdatedAt":1792724854894,"error":null,"errorUpdateCount":0,"errorUpdatedAt":0,"fetchFailureCount":0,"fetchMeta":null,"isFetching":false,"isInvalidated":false,"isPaused":false,"status":"success"},"queryKey":"AgendaDetail-club-void-sum-r-nl","queryHash":"[\"AgendaDetail-club-void-sum-r-nl\"]"},{"state":{"data":{"statusCode":200,"type":"OK","pageData":{"type":"event","nid":284,"slug":"/agenda/bridge-10-11-mei","endpoint":"/nl/agenda/bridge-10-11-mei","translations":{"nl":"/agenda/bridge-10-11-mei","en":null},"title":"BRIDGE - 10 \u0026 11 mei","content":"\u003cp\u003eEindhoven is een festival rijker: vanaf 10 mei 2023 staat de gitaar 5 dagen lang centraal tijdens het nieuwe \u003ca href=\"https://bridgefestival.com/\"\u003eBRIDGE\u003c/a\u003e! Het meerdaagse, allround gitaarfestival is uniek in zijn soort: van klassiek tot blues, van jazz tot rock, van flamenco tot pop, alles komt aan bod. Livemuziek speelt tijdens BRIDGE een grote rol, vele gitaristen zullen in verschillende formats afreizen naar het festival. Daarnaast worden volop andere programma’s aangeboden zoals workshops, masterclasses, een omvangrijke beurs, huiskamerconcerten en meerdere on- en offline activiteiten. En dat alles onder de noemer van een aantal pijlers: innovatie, educatie, participatie, inclusie en natuurlijk de grote gezamenlijke liefhebberij van de gitaar. Hiermee wordt er voldaan aan de behoefte binnen de gehele Brainport regio: verbinding, mét elkaar, vóór elkaar. Met andere woorden: we slaan van 10 tot en met 14 mei 2023 sámen een brug, BRIDGE is geboren! \u003c/p\u003e\r\n","meta":{"title":"BRIDGE","description":"Eindhoven is een festival rijker: vanaf 10 mei 2023 staat de gitaar 5 dagen lang centraal tijdens het nieuwe BRIDGE! Het meerdaagse, allround gitaarfestival is uniek in zijn soort: van klassiek tot blues, van jazz tot rock, van flamenco tot pop, alles komt aan bod. Livemuziek speelt tijdens BRIDGE een grote rol, vele gitaristen zullen in verschillende formats afreizen naar het festival. Daarnaast worden volop andere programma’s aangeboden zoals workshops, masterclasses, een omvangrijke beurs, huiskamerconcerten en meerdere on- en offline activiteiten. En dat alles onder de noemer van een aantal pijlers: innovatie, educatie, participatie, inclusie en natuurlijk de grote gezamenlijke liefhebberij van de gitaar. Hiermee wordt er voldaan aan de behoefte binnen de gehele Brainport regio: verbinding, mét elkaar, vóór elkaar. Met andere woorden: we slaan van 10 tot en met 14 mei 2023 sámen een brug, BRIDGE is geboren! ","image":{"image":{"alt":"Bridge Gitaarfestival Eindhoven","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=lHiuCEx0","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=ByRLFbJL","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=h2d3RlXX","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=v1yskyqK","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=LOow0-xK","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=m2QTOBO8"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=lHiuCEx0 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=ByRLFbJL 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=h2d3RlXX 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=v1yskyqK 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=LOow0-xK 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=m2QTOBO8 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null}},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1669021200,"machine":"2022-11-21T09:00:00+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_image":{"image":{"alt":"Bridge Gitaarfestival Eindhoven","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=lHiuCEx0","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=ByRLFbJL","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=h2d3RlXX","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=v1yskyqK","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=LOow0-xK","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=m2QTOBO8"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=lHiuCEx0 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=ByRLFbJL 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=h2d3RlXX 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=v1yskyqK 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=LOow0-xK 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-01/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=m2QTOBO8 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"colors":{"accent_color":"#8C8C8C","background_color":"#000000","text_color":"#FFFFFF"},"thumbnail_image":{"image":{"alt":"Bridge Gitaarfestival Eindhoven","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2022-11/Bridge_logo_social_no%20circle_tagline.png","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2022-11/Bridge_logo_social_no%20circle_tagline.png?itok=USHXQYzO","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2022-11/Bridge_logo_social_no%20circle_tagline.png?itok=FZAYuRWB","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2022-11/Bridge_logo_social_no%20circle_tagline.png?itok=jRDIx3RI","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2022-11/Bridge_logo_social_no%20circle_tagline.png?itok=lp92EQ1b","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2022-11/Bridge