ght","description":"Gitaarhelden verdienen een podium. En dat krijgen ze op 10 mei in de Effenaar. Met Leendert Haaksma, Vedran Mircetic en Menno Gootjes staan een paar van de grootste rockgitaristen van Nederland op het programma van deze Heroes Night. De gitaristen worden begeleid door Manuel Hugas op bas en Martijn Vink op drums. Deze Bridge Heroes Night wordt mede mogelijk gemaakt door Guitarmatrix.","image":{"image":{"alt":"BRIDGE Header","src":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg","sizes":{"1400w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=te0lZW38","1920w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=bd_a95cg","2510w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=fESHkbc3","320w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=svrSC29W","480w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=4Ehp5qYb","720w":"https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=qTzqHhxJ"},"srcset":["https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1400w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=te0lZW38 1400w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/1920w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=bd_a95cg 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=fESHkbc3 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=svrSC29W 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=4Ehp5qYb 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2023-03/Header%20BRIDGE%202.jpg?itok=qTzqHhxJ 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null}},"publish_date":{"timestamp":1678698760,"machine":"2023-03-13T09:12:40+00:00"},"published":true,"sticky":false,"header_ima