ebee%20new%20video.png?itok=Uh4LpcYN 1920w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/2510w/s3/2026-09/Admiral%20Freebee%20new%20video.png?itok=bs5AieUP 2510w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/320w/s3/2026-09/Admiral%20Freebee%20new%20video.png?itok=YZsNSrfh 320w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/480w/s3/2026-09/Admiral%20Freebee%20new%20video.png?itok=S2Vuqbmz 480w","https://d12y285rxlbnxt.cloudfront.net/styles/720w/s3/2026-09/Admiral%20Freebee%20new%20video.png?itok=ZqdEufuT 720w"]},"source":null,"source_link":null},"locations":[{"id":126,"title":"Kleine Zaal","is_external":false}],"state":null,"club_card_event":false,"colors":{"accent_color":"#7ea0d8","background_color":"#000000","text_color":"#FFFFFF"}}],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"fcc91d4d-db90-4aab-94cc-8dd569a751ca","header":{"title":null},"content":{"content":"\u003cp\u003eZe spelen onder andere de hits '1999', 'Little Red Corvette', 'Purple Rain', 'Kiss', 'Nothing Compares 2 U', 'I Wanna Be Your Lover', 'Musicology' en nog veel meer! Dit is een tribute-show als geen ander. Door de kracht van de muziek van Prince en de sfeer van zijn concerten centraal te stellen, is het \u0026nbsp;een show die je als fan van Prince moet hebben gezien! Met zo’n ruim assortiment aan nummers om uit te kiezen, is er geen show hetzelfde en is elke show zijn eigen magische moment!\u003c/p\u003e","links":null}},{"type":"embed","id":"cccbff47-66bf-4bfd-8e4f-38ed708fe135","header":{"title":null,"description":null},"content":{"embed":"\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Sh9SjodgpjM?si=9u_oPsG9eBUCTXo9\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","caption":null,"cookie_message":false}}]},"preview":false},"dataUpdateCount":1,"dataUpdatedAt":17927246974